window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/courses/a500-c85120e744363a2f.json"]={sha256:"c85120e744363a2f8c43157879818818df213f8e5ee982464f6c729b3b5a8b88",value:{"id":"a500","title":"FAST 五百公尺口徑球面電波望遠鏡","titleEn":"FAST Five-hundred-meter Aperture Spherical Telescope","category":"instruments","kind":"course","status":"guided","contentStatus":"reviewable-educational-curriculum","summary":"從半徑 300 m 球面的球差出發，理解 FAST 如何以約 2225 台促動器把 300 m 照明區即時拉成拋物面、用六索饋源艙追焦，再把天頂角極限、索網疲勞、面形量測、指向模型、19 波束接收機與電波寧靜區整合成可驗收的單口徑電波望遠鏡工程紀錄。","summaryEn":"Starting from the spherical aberration of a 300 m-radius sphere, see how FAST pulls a 300 m illuminated patch into a paraboloid with about 2225 actuators and follows the focus with a six-cable feed cabin, then integrate the zenith-angle limit, cable-net fatigue, surface metrology, pointing model, 19-beam receiver and radio quiet zone into an acceptable single-dish engineering record.","scope":"依公開物理原理與官方資料編寫的原創教學；步驟是可驗證的學習任務與假想算例，不是原廠配方、施工圖、設備操作許可或安全程序。數值均為教學假設，需依實際規格重算。","scopeEn":"Original teaching built from public physics and official sources. Steps are verifiable learning tasks and hypothetical exercises, not vendor recipes, construction drawings, operating authorisation or safety procedures. Numbers are teaching assumptions and must be recalculated for real specifications.","subcategory":"optics-facilities-observatories","subcategoryTitle":"大型望遠鏡與重力波觀測站","subcategoryTitleEn":"Large telescopes and gravitational-wave observatories","learningTrack":"optics","learningSubdiscipline":"optics-facilities-observatories","learningTags":["optics","optics-facilities-observatories","radio"],"architectureFamily":"radio","architectureNodes":[["主動反射面（面板與索網）","Active reflector (panels and cable net)"],["促動器與面形量測","Actuators and surface metrology"],["六索饋源艙與 Stewart 平台","Six-cable feed cabin and Stewart platform"],["19 波束 L 波段接收機","19-beam L-band receiver"],["光纖傳輸與數位後端","Fibre link and digital backend"],["觀測控制與指向模型","Observation control and pointing model"]],"architectureEdges":[[5,1],[1,0],[0,3],[5,2],[2,3],[3,4]],"diagram":{"type":"radio","labels":["主動反射面（面板與索網）","促動器與面形量測","六索饋源艙與 Stewart 平台","19 波束 L 波段接收機","光纖傳輸與數位後端"],"labelsEn":["Active reflector (panels and cable net)","Actuators and surface metrology","Six-cable feed cabin and Stewart platform","19-beam L-band receiver","Fibre link and digital backend"],"original":true,"notToScale":true},"workedExample":{"title":"原創假想算例與邊界","titleEn":"Original hypothetical example and boundaries","text":"HI 星系偵測練習：在 ζ = 20° 追蹤一個 50 Mpc 外的星系，A_e = 0.63 × π × 150² = 44 532 m²，G = 16.1 K/Jy，T_sys = 24 K，SEFD = 1.49 Jy。通道寬 7.63 kHz 在 1420.4 MHz 相當 1.61 km/s；雙偏振積分 600 s，σ = 1.49/√(2 × 7630 × 600) ≈ 0.49 mJy。200 km/s 的譜線涵蓋 124 個通道，積分流量雜訊 0.49 × 1.61 × √124 ≈ 8.8 mJy·km/s，5σ 門檻 0.044 Jy·km/s，對應 M_HI = 2.36×10⁵ × 50² × 0.044 ≈ 2.6×10⁷ 太陽質量。若同一目標只能在 ζ = 40° 觀測，幾何面積比 0.80 使 G 降到 12.9 K/Jy，溢出讓 T_sys 升到 28 K，SEFD 變 2.17 Jy，達到相同 σ 需要 (2.17/1.49)² ≈ 2.1 倍時間，約 1280 s。數值為教學假設，不代表任何實機規格。","textEn":"HI galaxy detection exercise: track a galaxy at 50 Mpc at ζ = 20°, with A_e = 0.63 × π × 150² = 44 532 m², G = 16.1 K/Jy, T_sys = 24 K and SEFD = 1.49 Jy. A 7.63 kHz channel at 1420.4 MHz is 1.61 km/s; integrating 600 s in two polarisations gives σ = 1.49/√(2 × 7630 × 600) ≈ 0.49 mJy. A 200 km/s line spans 124 channels, so the integrated-flux noise is 0.49 × 1.61 × √124 ≈ 8.8 mJy·km/s and the 5σ threshold is 0.044 Jy·km/s, corresponding to M_HI = 2.36×10⁵ × 50² × 0.044 ≈ 2.6×10⁷ solar masses. If the same target can only be observed at ζ = 40°, the geometric area fraction 0.80 lowers G to 12.9 K/Jy, spillover raises T_sys to 28 K and SEFD becomes 2.17 Jy, so reaching the same σ takes (2.17/1.49)² ≈ 2.1 times longer, about 1280 s. Values are teaching assumptions, not any instrument's specification.","assumptions":"數值是本課自行設定的教學假設，不代表實機量測、產品額定或操作參數；改變系統邊界後必須重算。","assumptionsEn":"Inputs are teaching assumptions, not measured hardware, product ratings or operating parameters; recalculate after changing the system boundary.","sourceScope":"原創數值練習；來源支援公開原理與設施背景，不宣稱來源提供這組數據。","sourceScopeEn":"Original numerical exercise; sources support public principles and facility context, not these numbers."},"depth":4,"languageCoverage":["zh-TW","en"],"simulationOnly":true,"educationEdition":12,"enrichmentVersion":12,"stages":[{"id":"a500-v12-s1","title":"系統邊界與物理原理","titleEn":"System boundaries and physical principles","description":"本階段聚焦「球面球差與主動拋物面成形」與「天頂角極限與有效接收面積」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Spherical aberration and active paraboloid forming\" and \"Zenith-angle limit and effective collecting area\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a500-v12-01","title":"球面球差與主動拋物面成形：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Spherical aberration and active paraboloid forming: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":[],"objective":"說明「500 m 球面與 300 m 照明口徑」如何決定FAST 五百公尺口徑球面電波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “500 m sphere and 300 m illuminated aperture” determines the key performance of “FAST Five-hundred-meter Aperture Spherical Telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"FAST 的反射面是半徑 R = 300 m、口徑 500 m 的球冠，安置在貴州平塘大窩凼的喀斯特窪地中。球面沒有特定光軸，只要移動饋源就能指向不同方向，但球面有球差：不同高度入射的平行光在軸上交於不同位置，單點饋源無法同相收集。Arecibo 用線饋源與格里高利副鏡修正；FAST 則用索網節點下方的促動器，把以源方向為軸、直徑 300 m 的一塊球面即時拉成 f/D = 0.4665 的拋物面，追蹤時讓這塊拋物面在球面上「移動」，饋源艙則沿焦面跟隨，其餘部分保持球面。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「500 m 球面與 300 m 照明口徑」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"FAST's reflector is a spherical cap of radius R = 300 m and aperture 500 m set into the Dawodang karst depression in Pingtang, Guizhou. A sphere has no preferred axis, so pointing only requires moving the feed, but it suffers spherical aberration: parallel rays at different heights cross the axis at different points and a point feed cannot collect them in phase. Arecibo corrected this with line feeds and a Gregorian subreflector; FAST instead uses actuators under the cable-net nodes to pull a 300 m-diameter patch, centred on the source direction, into a paraboloid with f/D = 0.4665, and tracks by moving that paraboloid across the sphere while the feed cabin follows along the focal surface and the rest of the dish stays spherical. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “500 m sphere and 300 m illuminated aperture”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：球差估算：近軸焦點在頂點上方 R/2 = 150 m；r = 150 m 的邊緣光（入射角 θ = 30°）交軸於距球心 R/(2cosθ) = 173.2 m，即頂點上方 126.8 m，縱向球差 23.2 m。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Aberration estimate: the paraxial focus is R/2 = 150 m above the vertex; the marginal ray at r = 150 m (incidence θ = 30°) crosses the axis R/(2cosθ) = 173.2 m from the centre, 126.8 m above the vertex, a longitudinal spherical aberration of 23.2 m.","failure":"常見誤解：「FAST 觀測時會把整個 500 m 反射面變成一個拋物面。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"FAST deforms its whole 500 m dish into a single paraboloid when observing.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「500 m 球面與 300 m 照明口徑」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “500 m sphere and 300 m illuminated aperture”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-01-k1","title":"球面球差與主動拋物面成形","titleEn":"Spherical aberration and active paraboloid forming","text":"FAST 的反射面是半徑 R = 300 m、口徑 500 m 的球冠，安置在貴州平塘大窩凼的喀斯特窪地中。球面沒有特定光軸，只要移動饋源就能指向不同方向，但球面有球差：不同高度入射的平行光在軸上交於不同位置，單點饋源無法同相收集。","textEn":"FAST's reflector is a spherical cap of radius R = 300 m and aperture 500 m set into the Dawodang karst depression in Pingtang, Guizhou. A sphere has no preferred axis, so pointing only requires moving the feed, but it suffers spherical aberration: parallel rays at different heights cross the axis at different points and a point feed cannot collect them in phase.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-01-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：FAST 觀測時會把整個 500 m 反射面變成一個拋物面。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: FAST deforms its whole 500 m dish into a single paraboloid when observing. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「球面球差與主動拋物面成形」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Spherical aberration and active paraboloid forming\" is correct?","options":["FAST 觀測時會把整個 500 m 反射面變成一個拋物面。","FAST 的反射面是半徑 R = 300 m、口徑 500 m 的球冠，安置在貴州平塘大窩凼的喀斯特窪地中。","FAST 反射面固定不動，所以增益與天頂角無關。"],"optionsEn":["FAST deforms its whole 500 m dish into a single paraboloid when observing.","FAST's reflector is a spherical cap of radius R = 300 m and aperture 500 m set into the Dawodang karst depression in Pingtang, Guizhou.","Because FAST's dish never moves, its gain does not depend on zenith angle."],"answer":1,"explanation":"FAST 的反射面是半徑 R = 300 m、口徑 500 m 的球冠，安置在貴州平塘大窩凼的喀斯特窪地中。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"FAST's reflector is a spherical cap of radius R = 300 m and aperture 500 m set into the Dawodang karst depression in Pingtang, Guizhou. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":1},{"id":"a500-v12-02","title":"球面球差與主動拋物面成形：定量估算","titleEn":"Spherical aberration and active paraboloid forming: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-01"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「500 m 球面與 300 m 照明口徑」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “500 m sphere and 300 m illuminated aperture” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：球差估算：近軸焦點在頂點上方 R/2 = 150 m；r = 150 m 的邊緣光（入射角 θ = 30°）交軸於距球心 R/(2cosθ) = 173.2 m，即頂點上方 126.8 m，縱向球差 23.2 m。拋物面焦距 F = 0.4665 × 300 = 139.95 m；若令拋物面在 r = 150 m 處與球面重合（兩者矢高都是 40.19 m），最大軸向偏離 0.72 m 出現在 r ≈ 106 m，換成法向約 0.72 × cos20.7° ≈ 0.67 m，促動器行程必須涵蓋此值再加裕度。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Aberration estimate: the paraxial focus is R/2 = 150 m above the vertex; the marginal ray at r = 150 m (incidence θ = 30°) crosses the axis R/(2cosθ) = 173.2 m from the centre, 126.8 m above the vertex, a longitudinal spherical aberration of 23.2 m. The paraboloid focal length is F = 0.4665 × 300 = 139.95 m; if it meets the sphere at r = 150 m (both sags 40.19 m), the largest axial departure is 0.72 m at r ≈ 106 m, about 0.72 × cos20.7° ≈ 0.67 m along the normal, which the actuator stroke must cover with margin. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以球心座標系計算目標拋物面對球面的偏離圖，核對下達給各節點的位移指令峰值約 0.67 m 且不超過促動器行程；成形後用全站儀量所有節點，對殘差擬合拋物面的頂點、焦點與軸向，確認擬合焦距接近 139.95 m、焦點與饋源艙位置一致；最後對強校準源做饋源軸向掃焦，增益最大值應落在幾何焦點附近。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Compute the departure map of the target paraboloid from the sphere in sphere-centred coordinates and check that the commanded node displacements peak near 0.67 m within actuator stroke; after forming, survey every node with total stations and fit vertex, focus and axis to the residuals, confirming a fitted focal length near 139.95 m and a focus coincident with the feed cabin; finally run an axial focus scan of the feed on a strong calibrator, whose gain maximum should fall near the geometric focus.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-02-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"球差估算：近軸焦點在頂點上方 R/2 = 150 m；r = 150 m 的邊緣光（入射角 θ = 30°）交軸於距球心 R/(2cosθ) = 173.2 m，即頂點上方 126.8 m，縱向球差 23.2 m。拋物面焦距 F = 0.4665 × 300 = 139.95 m；若令拋物面在 r = 150 m 處與球面重合（兩者矢高都是 40.19 m），最大軸向偏離 0.72 m 出現在 r ≈ 106 m，換成法向約 0.72 × cos20.7° ≈ 0.67 m，促動器行程必須涵蓋此值再加裕度。","textEn":"Aberration estimate: the paraxial focus is R/2 = 150 m above the vertex; the marginal ray at r = 150 m (incidence θ = 30°) crosses the axis R/(2cosθ) = 173.2 m from the centre, 126.8 m above the vertex, a longitudinal spherical aberration of 23.2 m. The paraboloid focal length is F = 0.4665 × 300 = 139.95 m; if it meets the sphere at r = 150 m (both sags 40.19 m), the largest axial departure is 0.72 m at r ≈ 106 m, about 0.72 × cos20.7° ≈ 0.67 m along the normal, which the actuator stroke must cover with margin.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-02-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「球面球差與主動拋物面成形」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Spherical aberration and active paraboloid forming\", which statement holds?","options":["只要控制六根鋼索長度，饋源艙就能直接達到毫米級定位。","相對 140 m 焦距，10 mm 的饋源誤差可以忽略。","球差估算：近軸焦點在頂點上方 R/2 = 150 m。"],"optionsEn":["Controlling the six cable lengths alone puts the feed cabin to millimetre accuracy.","A 10 mm feed error is negligible against a 140 m focal length.","Aberration estimate: the paraxial focus is R/2 = 150 m above the vertex."],"answer":2,"explanation":"球差估算：近軸焦點在頂點上方 R/2 = 150 m；r = 150 m 的邊緣光（入射角 θ = 30°）交軸於距球心 R/(2cosθ) = 173.2 m，即頂點上方 126.8 m，縱向球差 23.2 m。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Aberration estimate: the paraxial focus is R/2 = 150 m above the vertex; the marginal ray at r = 150 m (incidence θ = 30°) crosses the axis R/(2cosθ) = 173.2 m from the centre, 126.8 m above the vertex, a longitudinal spherical aberration of 23.2 m. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":2},{"id":"a500-v12-03","title":"球面球差與主動拋物面成形：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Spherical aberration and active paraboloid forming: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-02"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「500 m 球面與 300 m 照明口徑」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “500 m sphere and 300 m illuminated aperture” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以球心座標系計算目標拋物面對球面的偏離圖，核對下達給各節點的位移指令峰值約 0.67 m 且不超過促動器行程；成形後用全站儀量所有節點，對殘差擬合拋物面的頂點、焦點與軸向，確認擬合焦距接近 139.95 m、焦點與饋源艙位置一致；最後對強校準源做饋源軸向掃焦，增益最大值應落在幾何焦點附近。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Compute the departure map of the target paraboloid from the sphere in sphere-centred coordinates and check that the commanded node displacements peak near 0.67 m within actuator stroke; after forming, survey every node with total stations and fit vertex, focus and axis to the residuals, confirming a fitted focal length near 139.95 m and a focus coincident with the feed cabin; finally run an axial focus scan of the feed on a strong calibrator, whose gain maximum should fall near the geometric focus. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：若焦距參數或拋物面軸向與源方向不同步，饋源不在真正焦點，主波束變寬、旁瓣升高、增益下降；若某區促動器在 0.67 m 峰值處飽和，會留下一圈仍是球面的環帶，形成環狀相位誤差，波束圖出現不對稱的彗形旁瓣。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: If the focal-length parameter or paraboloid axis falls out of step with the source direction, the feed is not at the true focus, so the main beam broadens, sidelobes rise and gain drops; if actuators saturate near the 0.67 m peak zone, a ring of residual sphere remains, producing an annular phase error and asymmetric coma-like sidelobes in the beam map.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-03-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以球心座標系計算目標拋物面對球面的偏離圖，核對下達給各節點的位移指令峰值約 0.67 m 且不超過促動器行程；成形後用全站儀量所有節點，對殘差擬合拋物面的頂點、焦點與軸向，確認擬合焦距接近 139.95 m、焦點與饋源艙位置一致；最後對強校準源做饋源軸向掃焦，增益最大值應落在幾何焦點附近。","textEn":"Compute the departure map of the target paraboloid from the sphere in sphere-centred coordinates and check that the commanded node displacements peak near 0.67 m within actuator stroke; after forming, survey every node with total stations and fit vertex, focus and axis to the residuals, confirming a fitted focal length near 139.95 m and a focus coincident with the feed cabin; finally run an axial focus scan of the feed on a strong calibrator, whose gain maximum should fall near the geometric focus.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-03-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「球面球差與主動拋物面成形」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Spherical aberration and active paraboloid forming\"?","options":["以球心座標系計算目標拋物面對球面的偏離圖，核對下達給各節點的位移指令峰值約 0.67 m 且不超過促動器行程。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","頻譜基線漣波只來自接收機電子，與望遠鏡幾何無關。"],"optionsEn":["Compute the departure map of the target paraboloid from the sphere in sphere-centred coordinates and check that the commanded node displacements peak near 0.67 m within actuator stroke.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","Spectral baseline ripple comes only from receiver electronics, not telescope geometry."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以球心座標系計算目標拋物面對球面的偏離圖，核對下達給各節點的位移指令峰值約 0.67 m 且不超過促動器行程；成形後用全站儀量所有節點，對殘差擬合拋物面的頂點、焦點與軸向，確認擬合焦距接近 139.95 m、焦點與饋源艙位置一致；最後對強校準源做饋源軸向掃焦，增益最大值應落在幾何焦點附近。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Compute the departure map of the target paraboloid from the sphere in sphere-centred coordinates and check that the commanded node displacements peak near 0.67 m within actuator stroke; after forming, survey every node with total stations and fit vertex, focus and axis to the residuals, confirming a fitted focal length near 139.95 m and a focus coincident with the feed cabin; finally run an axial focus scan of the feed on a strong calibrator, whose gain maximum should fall near the geometric focus. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":3},{"id":"a500-v12-04","title":"球面球差與主動拋物面成形：失效診斷","titleEn":"Spherical aberration and active paraboloid forming: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-03"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「500 m 球面與 300 m 照明口徑」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “500 m sphere and 300 m illuminated aperture” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"若焦距參數或拋物面軸向與源方向不同步，饋源不在真正焦點，主波束變寬、旁瓣升高、增益下降；若某區促動器在 0.67 m 峰值處飽和，會留下一圈仍是球面的環帶，形成環狀相位誤差，波束圖出現不對稱的彗形旁瓣。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"If the focal-length parameter or paraboloid axis falls out of step with the source direction, the feed is not at the true focus, so the main beam broadens, sidelobes rise and gain drops; if actuators saturate near the 0.67 m peak zone, a ring of residual sphere remains, producing an annular phase error and asymmetric coma-like sidelobes in the beam map. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：Arecibo 用線饋源與格里高利副鏡修正；FAST 則用索網節點下方的促動器，把以源方向為軸、直徑 300 m 的一塊球面即時拉成 f/D = 0.4665 的拋物面，追蹤時讓這塊拋物面在球面上「移動」，饋源艙則沿焦面跟隨，其餘部分保持球面。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Arecibo corrected this with line feeds and a Gregorian subreflector; FAST instead uses actuators under the cable-net nodes to pull a 300 m-diameter patch, centred on the source direction, into a paraboloid with f/D = 0.4665, and tracks by moving that paraboloid across the sphere while the feed cabin follows along the focal surface and the rest of the dish stays spherical.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「FAST 觀測時會把整個 500 m 反射面變成一個拋物面。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"FAST deforms its whole 500 m dish into a single paraboloid when observing.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-04-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"若焦距參數或拋物面軸向與源方向不同步，饋源不在真正焦點，主波束變寬、旁瓣升高、增益下降；若某區促動器在 0.67 m 峰值處飽和，會留下一圈仍是球面的環帶，形成環狀相位誤差，波束圖出現不對稱的彗形旁瓣。","textEn":"If the focal-length parameter or paraboloid axis falls out of step with the source direction, the feed is not at the true focus, so the main beam broadens, sidelobes rise and gain drops; if actuators saturate near the 0.67 m peak zone, a ring of residual sphere remains, producing an annular phase error and asymmetric coma-like sidelobes in the beam map.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-04-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「球面球差與主動拋物面成形」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Spherical aberration and active paraboloid forming\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","若焦距參數或拋物面軸向與源方向不同步，饋源不在真正焦點，主波束變寬、旁瓣升高、增益下降。","FAST 反射面固定不動，所以增益與天頂角無關。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","If the focal-length parameter or paraboloid axis falls out of step with the source direction, the feed is not at the true focus, so the main beam broadens, sidelobes rise and gain drops.","Because FAST's dish never moves, its gain does not depend on zenith angle."],"answer":1,"explanation":"若焦距參數或拋物面軸向與源方向不同步，饋源不在真正焦點，主波束變寬、旁瓣升高、增益下降；若某區促動器在 0.67 m 峰值處飽和，會留下一圈仍是球面的環帶，形成環狀相位誤差，波束圖出現不對稱的彗形旁瓣。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"If the focal-length parameter or paraboloid axis falls out of step with the source direction, the feed is not at the true focus, so the main beam broadens, sidelobes rise and gain drops; if actuators saturate near the 0.67 m peak zone, a ring of residual sphere remains, producing an annular phase error and asymmetric coma-like sidelobes in the beam map. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":1,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":4},{"id":"a500-v12-05","title":"天頂角極限與有效接收面積：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Zenith-angle limit and effective collecting area: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-04"],"objective":"說明「天頂角與照明區位置」如何決定FAST 五百公尺口徑球面電波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Zenith angle and illuminated patch” determines the key performance of “FAST Five-hundred-meter Aperture Spherical Telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"從球心看，300 m 照明口徑對應距波束軸 30° 以內的球冠，而 500 m 邊緣位於距鉛垂 56.4° 處（張角 112.9°）。源在天上移動時，照明區在球面上遊走；只要天頂角 ζ ≤ 56.4° − 30° = 26.4°，整個 300 m 口徑都留在反射面上。超過此角度，部分照明口徑落到邊緣之外，饋源開始看見地面，有效面積下降、溢出雜訊使系統溫度上升。設計上限 ζ = 40°，配合約 25.6°N 的緯度，可觀測赤緯約 −14° 到 +66°。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「天頂角與照明區位置」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Seen from the sphere centre, the 300 m illuminated aperture is the cap within 30° of the beam axis, while the 500 m rim lies 56.4° from the vertical, an opening angle of 112.9°. As a source moves the illuminated patch walks across the sphere, and as long as the zenith angle ζ ≤ 56.4° − 30° = 26.4° the full 300 m aperture stays on the reflector. Beyond that part of the illuminated aperture falls off the rim, the feed begins to see the ground, effective area drops and spillover noise raises the system temperature. The design limit is ζ = 40°, which at about 25.6°N latitude gives declinations from about −14° to +66°. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Zenith angle and illuminated patch”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：ζ ≤ 26.4° 時，A_e = η·π(150 m)² = 0.63 × 70 686 = 44 532 m²，增益 G = A_e/(2k) ≈ 16.1 K/Jy，SEFD = T_sys/G = 24/16.1 ≈ 1.49 Jy。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: For ζ ≤ 26.4°, A_e = η·π(150 m)² = 0.63 × 70 686 = 44 532 m², gain G = A_e/(2k) ≈ 16.1 K/Jy and SEFD = T_sys/G = 24/16.1 ≈ 1.49 Jy.","failure":"常見誤解：「FAST 反射面固定不動，所以增益與天頂角無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Because FAST's dish never moves, its gain does not depend on zenith angle.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「天頂角與照明區位置」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Zenith angle and illuminated patch”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-05-k1","title":"天頂角極限與有效接收面積","titleEn":"Zenith-angle limit and effective collecting area","text":"從球心看，300 m 照明口徑對應距波束軸 30° 以內的球冠，而 500 m 邊緣位於距鉛垂 56.4° 處（張角 112.9°）。源在天上移動時，照明區在球面上遊走；只要天頂角 ζ ≤ 56.4° − 30° = 26.4°，整個 300 m 口徑都留在反射面上。","textEn":"Seen from the sphere centre, the 300 m illuminated aperture is the cap within 30° of the beam axis, while the 500 m rim lies 56.4° from the vertical, an opening angle of 112.9°. As a source moves the illuminated patch walks across the sphere, and as long as the zenith angle ζ ≤ 56.4° − 30° = 26.4° the full 300 m aperture stays on the reflector.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-05-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：FAST 反射面固定不動，所以增益與天頂角無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Because FAST's dish never moves, its gain does not depend on zenith angle. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「天頂角極限與有效接收面積」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Zenith-angle limit and effective collecting area\" is correct?","options":["FAST 反射面固定不動，所以增益與天頂角無關。","索網只承受靜態重量，不必考慮疲勞壽命。","從球心看，300 m 照明口徑對應距波束軸 30° 以內的球冠，而 500 m 邊緣位於距鉛垂 56.4° 處（張角 112.9°）。"],"optionsEn":["Because FAST's dish never moves, its gain does not depend on zenith angle.","The cable net carries only static weight, so fatigue life can be ignored.","Seen from the sphere centre, the 300 m illuminated aperture is the cap within 30° of the beam axis, while the 500 m rim lies 56.4° from the vertical, an opening angle of 112.9°."],"answer":2,"explanation":"從球心看，300 m 照明口徑對應距波束軸 30° 以內的球冠，而 500 m 邊緣位於距鉛垂 56.4° 處（張角 112.9°）。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Seen from the sphere centre, the 300 m illuminated aperture is the cap within 30° of the beam axis, while the 500 m rim lies 56.4° from the vertical, an opening angle of 112.9°. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":5},{"id":"a500-v12-06","title":"天頂角極限與有效接收面積：定量估算","titleEn":"Zenith-angle limit and effective collecting area: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-05"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「天頂角與照明區位置」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Zenith angle and illuminated patch” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：ζ ≤ 26.4° 時，A_e = η·π(150 m)² = 0.63 × 70 686 = 44 532 m²，增益 G = A_e/(2k) ≈ 16.1 K/Jy，SEFD = T_sys/G = 24/16.1 ≈ 1.49 Jy。幾何估算 300 m 口徑仍留在反射面上的比例：ζ = 30° 為 0.97、35° 為 0.90、40° 為 0.80（均勻照明）；若以 −10 dB 邊緣錐度加權，40° 時約 0.89。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: For ζ ≤ 26.4°, A_e = η·π(150 m)² = 0.63 × 70 686 = 44 532 m², gain G = A_e/(2k) ≈ 16.1 K/Jy and SEFD = T_sys/G = 24/16.1 ≈ 1.49 Jy. A geometric estimate of the fraction of the 300 m aperture still on the dish is 0.97 at ζ = 30°, 0.90 at 35° and 0.80 at 40° for uniform illumination, or about 0.89 at 40° when weighted by a −10 dB edge taper. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：建立增益曲線：在多個天頂角對 3C286 等流量已知的校準源做十字掃描，取峰值天線溫度除以目錄流量得到 K/Jy，畫出對 ζ 的曲線並確認轉折出現在 26.4° 附近；同一時間用雜訊二極體量各 ζ 的 T_sys，把面積下降與溢出升溫兩個效應分開記錄。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Build the gain curve: cross-scan a calibrator of known flux such as 3C286 at several zenith angles, divide peak antenna temperature by catalogue flux to obtain K/Jy, plot against ζ and confirm the knee near 26.4°; at the same time measure T_sys with the noise diode at each ζ so that area loss and spillover heating are recorded separately.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-06-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"ζ ≤ 26.4° 時，A_e = η·π(150 m)² = 0.63 × 70 686 = 44 532 m²，增益 G = A_e/(2k) ≈ 16.1 K/Jy，SEFD = T_sys/G = 24/16.1 ≈ 1.49 Jy。幾何估算 300 m 口徑仍留在反射面上的比例：ζ = 30° 為 0.97、35° 為 0.90、40° 為 0.80（均勻照明）；若以 −10 dB 邊緣錐度加權，40° 時約 0.89。","textEn":"For ζ ≤ 26.4°, A_e = η·π(150 m)² = 0.63 × 70 686 = 44 532 m², gain G = A_e/(2k) ≈ 16.1 K/Jy and SEFD = T_sys/G = 24/16.1 ≈ 1.49 Jy. A geometric estimate of the fraction of the 300 m aperture still on the dish is 0.97 at ζ = 30°, 0.90 at 35° and 0.80 at 40° for uniform illumination, or about 0.89 at 40° when weighted by a −10 dB edge taper.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-06-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「天頂角極限與有效接收面積」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Zenith-angle limit and effective collecting area\", which statement holds?","options":["ζ ≤ 26.4° 時，A_e = η·π(150 m)² = 0.63 × 70 686 = 44 532 m²，增益 G = A_e/(2k) ≈ 16.1 K/Jy，SEFD = T_sys/G = 24/16.1 ≈ 1.49 Jy。","5 mm 的面形精度在 500 MHz 與 3 GHz 一樣好。","頻譜基線漣波只來自接收機電子，與望遠鏡幾何無關。"],"optionsEn":["For ζ ≤ 26.4°, A_e = η·π(150 m)² = 0.63 × 70 686 = 44 532 m², gain G = A_e/(2k) ≈ 16.1 K/Jy and SEFD = T_sys/G = 24/16.1 ≈ 1.49 Jy.","A 5 mm surface performs equally well at 500 MHz and 3 GHz.","Spectral baseline ripple comes only from receiver electronics, not telescope geometry."],"answer":0,"explanation":"ζ ≤ 26.4° 時，A_e = η·π(150 m)² = 0.63 × 70 686 = 44 532 m²，增益 G = A_e/(2k) ≈ 16.1 K/Jy，SEFD = T_sys/G = 24/16.1 ≈ 1.49 Jy。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"For ζ ≤ 26.4°, A_e = η·π(150 m)² = 0.63 × 70 686 = 44 532 m², gain G = A_e/(2k) ≈ 16.1 K/Jy and SEFD = T_sys/G = 24/16.1 ≈ 1.49 Jy. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":6},{"id":"a500-v12-07","title":"天頂角極限與有效接收面積：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Zenith-angle limit and effective collecting area: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-06"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「天頂角與照明區位置」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Zenith angle and illuminated patch” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"建立增益曲線：在多個天頂角對 3C286 等流量已知的校準源做十字掃描，取峰值天線溫度除以目錄流量得到 K/Jy，畫出對 ζ 的曲線並確認轉折出現在 26.4° 附近；同一時間用雜訊二極體量各 ζ 的 T_sys，把面積下降與溢出升溫兩個效應分開記錄。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Build the gain curve: cross-scan a calibrator of known flux such as 3C286 at several zenith angles, divide peak antenna temperature by catalogue flux to obtain K/Jy, plot against ζ and confirm the knee near 26.4°; at the same time measure T_sys with the noise diode at each ζ so that area loss and spillover heating are recorded separately. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：對 ζ = 35° 到 40° 的觀測仍套用天頂增益，流量密度與 HI 質量會被低估 10% 到 20%；長時間追蹤跨越 26.4° 時，源看起來在「變亮變暗」，其實只是幾何遮蔽造成的假變光。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Applying the zenith gain to observations at ζ = 35° to 40° underestimates flux densities and HI masses by 10% to 20%; long tracks crossing 26.4° show a source apparently brightening and fading when the variation is purely geometric vignetting.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-07-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"建立增益曲線：在多個天頂角對 3C286 等流量已知的校準源做十字掃描，取峰值天線溫度除以目錄流量得到 K/Jy，畫出對 ζ 的曲線並確認轉折出現在 26.4° 附近；同一時間用雜訊二極體量各 ζ 的 T_sys，把面積下降與溢出升溫兩個效應分開記錄。","textEn":"Build the gain curve: cross-scan a calibrator of known flux such as 3C286 at several zenith angles, divide peak antenna temperature by catalogue flux to obtain K/Jy, plot against ζ and confirm the knee near 26.4°; at the same time measure T_sys with the noise diode at each ζ so that area loss and spillover heating are recorded separately.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-07-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「天頂角極限與有效接收面積」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Zenith-angle limit and effective collecting area\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","建立增益曲線：在多個天頂角對 3C286 等流量已知的校準源做十字掃描，取峰值天線溫度除以目錄流量得到 K/Jy，畫出對 ζ 的曲線並確認轉折出現在 26.4° 附近。","電波寧靜區可以擋掉所有干擾，包括衛星訊號。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Build the gain curve: cross-scan a calibrator of known flux such as 3C286 at several zenith angles, divide peak antenna temperature by catalogue flux to obtain K/Jy, plot against ζ and confirm the knee near 26.4°.","A radio quiet zone blocks all interference, satellite signals included."],"answer":1,"explanation":"建立增益曲線：在多個天頂角對 3C286 等流量已知的校準源做十字掃描，取峰值天線溫度除以目錄流量得到 K/Jy，畫出對 ζ 的曲線並確認轉折出現在 26.4° 附近；同一時間用雜訊二極體量各 ζ 的 T_sys，把面積下降與溢出升溫兩個效應分開記錄。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Build the gain curve: cross-scan a calibrator of known flux such as 3C286 at several zenith angles, divide peak antenna temperature by catalogue flux to obtain K/Jy, plot against ζ and confirm the knee near 26.4°; at the same time measure T_sys with the noise diode at each ζ so that area loss and spillover heating are recorded separately. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":7},{"id":"a500-v12-08","title":"天頂角極限與有效接收面積：失效診斷","titleEn":"Zenith-angle limit and effective collecting area: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-07"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「天頂角與照明區位置」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Zenith angle and illuminated patch” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"對 ζ = 35° 到 40° 的觀測仍套用天頂增益，流量密度與 HI 質量會被低估 10% 到 20%；長時間追蹤跨越 26.4° 時，源看起來在「變亮變暗」，其實只是幾何遮蔽造成的假變光。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Applying the zenith gain to observations at ζ = 35° to 40° underestimates flux densities and HI masses by 10% to 20%; long tracks crossing 26.4° show a source apparently brightening and fading when the variation is purely geometric vignetting. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：設計上限 ζ = 40°，配合約 25.6°N 的緯度，可觀測赤緯約 −14° 到 +66°。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The design limit is ζ = 40°, which at about 25.6°N latitude gives declinations from about −14° to +66°.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「FAST 反射面固定不動，所以增益與天頂角無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Because FAST's dish never moves, its gain does not depend on zenith angle.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-08-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"對 ζ = 35° 到 40° 的觀測仍套用天頂增益，流量密度與 HI 質量會被低估 10% 到 20%；長時間追蹤跨越 26.4° 時，源看起來在「變亮變暗」，其實只是幾何遮蔽造成的假變光。","textEn":"Applying the zenith gain to observations at ζ = 35° to 40° underestimates flux densities and HI masses by 10% to 20%; long tracks crossing 26.4° show a source apparently brightening and fading when the variation is purely geometric vignetting.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-08-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「天頂角極限與有效接收面積」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Zenith-angle limit and effective collecting area\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","索網只承受靜態重量，不必考慮疲勞壽命。","對 ζ = 35° 到 40° 的觀測仍套用天頂增益，流量密度與 HI 質量會被低估 10% 到 20%。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","The cable net carries only static weight, so fatigue life can be ignored.","Applying the zenith gain to observations at ζ = 35° to 40° underestimates flux densities and HI masses by 10% to 20%."],"answer":2,"explanation":"對 ζ = 35° 到 40° 的觀測仍套用天頂增益，流量密度與 HI 質量會被低估 10% 到 20%；長時間追蹤跨越 26.4° 時，源看起來在「變亮變暗」，其實只是幾何遮蔽造成的假變光。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Applying the zenith gain to observations at ζ = 35° to 40° underestimates flux densities and HI masses by 10% to 20%; long tracks crossing 26.4° show a source apparently brightening and fading when the variation is purely geometric vignetting. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":2,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":8}],"order":1},{"id":"a500-v12-s2","title":"元件、材料與製造","titleEn":"Components, materials and fabrication","description":"本階段聚焦「面板、索網與抗疲勞鋼索」與「索驅饋源艙的粗精兩級定位」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Panels, cable net and fatigue-resistant cables\" and \"Two-stage positioning of the cable-driven feed cabin\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a500-v12-09","title":"面板、索網與抗疲勞鋼索：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Panels, cable net and fatigue-resistant cables: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-08"],"objective":"說明「三角面板、索網節點與促動器」如何決定FAST 五百公尺口徑球面電波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Triangular panels, cable-net nodes and actuators” determines the key performance of “FAST Five-hundred-meter Aperture Spherical Telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"反射面由約 4450 塊邊長約 11 m 的三角形穿孔鋁面板組成，鋪在約 6670 根主索構成的索網上，索網懸掛於 500 m 圈樑；約 2225 個節點各以下拉索連到地面促動器。面板做成半徑 318.5 m 的球面，是折衷值：拋物面的局部曲率半徑在頂點為 280 m，到邊緣弧矢方向約 318 m、子午方向約 409 m。每次換源都改變拋物面位置，索網反覆承受應力循環；公開資料指出 FAST 的鋼索需承受約 500 MPa 應力幅、兩百萬次循環，約為一般規範的兩倍，因此必須開發新的鋼絞線與錨固工藝。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「三角面板、索網節點與促動器」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The surface consists of about 4450 triangular perforated aluminium panels roughly 11 m on a side, laid on a cable net of about 6670 main cables hung from a 500 m ring beam, and about 2225 nodes each tied by a down-tie cable to a ground actuator. Panels are spherical with radius 318.5 m as a compromise, because the paraboloid's local radius of curvature is 280 m at the vertex and about 318 m sagittally and 409 m meridionally at the edge. Every change of source moves the paraboloid, so the net sees repeated stress cycles; public reports state that FAST's cables had to survive about 500 MPa stress amplitude for two million cycles, roughly twice the usual code value, which required new steel-strand and anchorage technology. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Triangular panels, cable-net nodes and actuators”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：應力循環量級估算：球面上節點法向位移 δ 使面內長度改變約 δ/R，Δσ ≈ E·δ/R = 200 GPa × 0.47 m / 300 m ≈ 313 MPa；在 0.67 m 峰值處約 447 MPa，已接近 500 MPa 的疲勞要求。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Order-of-magnitude stress cycle: a normal node displacement δ on the sphere changes in-surface length by about δ/R, so Δσ ≈ E·δ/R = 200 GPa × 0.47 m / 300 m ≈ 313 MPa, and about 447 MPa at the 0.67 m peak, close to the 500 MPa fatigue requirement.","failure":"常見誤解：「索網只承受靜態重量，不必考慮疲勞壽命。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"The cable net carries only static weight, so fatigue life can be ignored.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「三角面板、索網節點與促動器」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Triangular panels, cable-net nodes and actuators”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-09-k1","title":"面板、索網與抗疲勞鋼索","titleEn":"Panels, cable net and fatigue-resistant cables","text":"反射面由約 4450 塊邊長約 11 m 的三角形穿孔鋁面板組成，鋪在約 6670 根主索構成的索網上，索網懸掛於 500 m 圈樑；約 2225 個節點各以下拉索連到地面促動器。面板做成半徑 318.5 m 的球面，是折衷值：拋物面的局部曲率半徑在頂點為 280 m，到邊緣弧矢方向約 318 m、子午方向約 409 m。","textEn":"The surface consists of about 4450 triangular perforated aluminium panels roughly 11 m on a side, laid on a cable net of about 6670 main cables hung from a 500 m ring beam, and about 2225 nodes each tied by a down-tie cable to a ground actuator. Panels are spherical with radius 318.5 m as a compromise, because the paraboloid's local radius of curvature is 280 m at the vertex and about 318 m sagittally and 409 m meridionally at the edge.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-09-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：索網只承受靜態重量，不必考慮疲勞壽命。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: The cable net carries only static weight, so fatigue life can be ignored. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「面板、索網與抗疲勞鋼索」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Panels, cable net and fatigue-resistant cables\" is correct?","options":["反射面由約 4450 塊邊長約 11 m 的三角形穿孔鋁面板組成，鋪在約 6670 根主索構成的索網上，索網懸掛於 500 m 圈樑。","索網只承受靜態重量，不必考慮疲勞壽命。","只要控制六根鋼索長度，饋源艙就能直接達到毫米級定位。"],"optionsEn":["The surface consists of about 4450 triangular perforated aluminium panels roughly 11 m on a side, laid on a cable net of about 6670 main cables hung from a 500 m ring beam, and about 2225 nodes each tied by a down-tie cable to a ground actuator.","The cable net carries only static weight, so fatigue life can be ignored.","Controlling the six cable lengths alone puts the feed cabin to millimetre accuracy."],"answer":0,"explanation":"反射面由約 4450 塊邊長約 11 m 的三角形穿孔鋁面板組成，鋪在約 6670 根主索構成的索網上，索網懸掛於 500 m 圈樑；約 2225 個節點各以下拉索連到地面促動器。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The surface consists of about 4450 triangular perforated aluminium panels roughly 11 m on a side, laid on a cable net of about 6670 main cables hung from a 500 m ring beam, and about 2225 nodes each tied by a down-tie cable to a ground actuator. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":9},{"id":"a500-v12-10","title":"面板、索網與抗疲勞鋼索：定量估算","titleEn":"Panels, cable net and fatigue-resistant cables: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-09"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「三角面板、索網節點與促動器」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Triangular panels, cable-net nodes and actuators” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：應力循環量級估算：球面上節點法向位移 δ 使面內長度改變約 δ/R，Δσ ≈ E·δ/R = 200 GPa × 0.47 m / 300 m ≈ 313 MPa；在 0.67 m 峰值處約 447 MPa，已接近 500 MPa 的疲勞要求。面板曲率失配：外接圓半徑 6.35 m 的面板，在 318.5 m 球面上矢高 63.3 mm、在 280 m 上 72.0 mm，頂點附近峰值差 8.7 mm，最佳擬合後約 8.7/√12 ≈ 2.5 mm rms。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Order-of-magnitude stress cycle: a normal node displacement δ on the sphere changes in-surface length by about δ/R, so Δσ ≈ E·δ/R = 200 GPa × 0.47 m / 300 m ≈ 313 MPa, and about 447 MPa at the 0.67 m peak, close to the 500 MPa fatigue requirement. Panel curvature mismatch: a panel of circumradius 6.35 m has a sag of 63.3 mm on a 318.5 m sphere and 72.0 mm on 280 m, an 8.7 mm peak difference near the vertex, about 8.7/√12 ≈ 2.5 mm rms after best fit. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：安裝前抽樣對鋼索與錨具做疲勞試驗，以 500 MPa 應力幅跑滿兩百萬次並檢查斷絲與錨具裂紋；運轉中在代表性主索上裝索力感測器，對每種拋物面位置比較實測索力與有限元素模型；面板出廠前以攝影測量或雷射掃描量面形，安裝後再抽查。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Before installation fatigue-test sample cables and anchors at 500 MPa stress amplitude for the full two million cycles and inspect for broken wires and anchor cracks; in service fit force sensors to representative main cables and compare measured tension with the finite-element model for each paraboloid position; measure panel shape by photogrammetry or laser scanning at the factory and spot-check after installation.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-10-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"應力循環量級估算：球面上節點法向位移 δ 使面內長度改變約 δ/R，Δσ ≈ E·δ/R = 200 GPa × 0.47 m / 300 m ≈ 313 MPa；在 0.67 m 峰值處約 447 MPa，已接近 500 MPa 的疲勞要求。面板曲率失配：外接圓半徑 6.35 m 的面板，在 318.5 m 球面上矢高 63.3 mm、在 280 m 上 72.0 mm，頂點附近峰值差 8.7 mm，最佳擬合後約 8.7/√12 ≈ 2.5 mm rms。","textEn":"Order-of-magnitude stress cycle: a normal node displacement δ on the sphere changes in-surface length by about δ/R, so Δσ ≈ E·δ/R = 200 GPa × 0.47 m / 300 m ≈ 313 MPa, and about 447 MPa at the 0.67 m peak, close to the 500 MPa fatigue requirement. Panel curvature mismatch: a panel of circumradius 6.35 m has a sag of 63.3 mm on a 318.5 m sphere and 72.0 mm on 280 m, an 8.7 mm peak difference near the vertex, about 8.7/√12 ≈ 2.5 mm rms after best fit.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-10-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「面板、索網與抗疲勞鋼索」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Panels, cable net and fatigue-resistant cables\", which statement holds?","options":["相對 140 m 焦距，10 mm 的饋源誤差可以忽略。","應力循環量級估算：球面上節點法向位移 δ 使面內長度改變約 δ/R，Δσ ≈ E·δ/R = 200 GPa × 0.47 m / 300 m ≈ 313 MPa。","電波寧靜區可以擋掉所有干擾，包括衛星訊號。"],"optionsEn":["A 10 mm feed error is negligible against a 140 m focal length.","Order-of-magnitude stress cycle: a normal node displacement δ on the sphere changes in-surface length by about δ/R, so Δσ ≈ E·δ/R = 200 GPa × 0.47 m / 300 m ≈ 313 MPa, and about 447 MPa at the 0.67 m peak, close to the 500 MPa fatigue requirement.","A radio quiet zone blocks all interference, satellite signals included."],"answer":1,"explanation":"應力循環量級估算：球面上節點法向位移 δ 使面內長度改變約 δ/R，Δσ ≈ E·δ/R = 200 GPa × 0.47 m / 300 m ≈ 313 MPa；在 0.67 m 峰值處約 447 MPa，已接近 500 MPa 的疲勞要求。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Order-of-magnitude stress cycle: a normal node displacement δ on the sphere changes in-surface length by about δ/R, so Δσ ≈ E·δ/R = 200 GPa × 0.47 m / 300 m ≈ 313 MPa, and about 447 MPa at the 0.67 m peak, close to the 500 MPa fatigue requirement. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":10},{"id":"a500-v12-11","title":"面板、索網與抗疲勞鋼索：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Panels, cable net and fatigue-resistant cables: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-10"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「三角面板、索網節點與促動器」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Triangular panels, cable-net nodes and actuators” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"安裝前抽樣對鋼索與錨具做疲勞試驗，以 500 MPa 應力幅跑滿兩百萬次並檢查斷絲與錨具裂紋；運轉中在代表性主索上裝索力感測器，對每種拋物面位置比較實測索力與有限元素模型；面板出廠前以攝影測量或雷射掃描量面形，安裝後再抽查。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Before installation fatigue-test sample cables and anchors at 500 MPa stress amplitude for the full two million cycles and inspect for broken wires and anchor cracks; in service fit force sensors to representative main cables and compare measured tension with the finite-element model for each paraboloid position; measure panel shape by photogrammetry or laser scanning at the factory and spot-check after installation. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：錨具處的疲勞裂紋或腐蝕使單根主索斷裂，載重重新分配，附近節點位置與面形同時偏移；晴天時鋁面板 11 m × 23 ppm/K × 20 K ≈ 5 mm 的熱伸長若因連接件卡死而無法滑動，面板翹曲，局部面形誤差遠超預算。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Fatigue cracking or corrosion at an anchor breaks a main cable, loads redistribute and nearby node positions and surface shape shift together; on sunny days an aluminium panel grows about 11 m × 23 ppm/K × 20 K ≈ 5 mm, and if seized connectors stop it sliding the panel warps and the local surface error far exceeds budget.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-11-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"安裝前抽樣對鋼索與錨具做疲勞試驗，以 500 MPa 應力幅跑滿兩百萬次並檢查斷絲與錨具裂紋；運轉中在代表性主索上裝索力感測器，對每種拋物面位置比較實測索力與有限元素模型；面板出廠前以攝影測量或雷射掃描量面形，安裝後再抽查。","textEn":"Before installation fatigue-test sample cables and anchors at 500 MPa stress amplitude for the full two million cycles and inspect for broken wires and anchor cracks; in service fit force sensors to representative main cables and compare measured tension with the finite-element model for each paraboloid position; measure panel shape by photogrammetry or laser scanning at the factory and spot-check after installation.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-11-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「面板、索網與抗疲勞鋼索」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Panels, cable net and fatigue-resistant cables\"?","options":["只看單次讀值或外觀即可判定合格，不需要基準件或重複量測。","FAST 觀測時會把整個 500 m 反射面變成一個拋物面。","安裝前抽樣對鋼索與錨具做疲勞試驗，以 500 MPa 應力幅跑滿兩百萬次並檢查斷絲與錨具裂紋。"],"optionsEn":["A single reading or a visual impression is enough to accept the result; no reference artefact or repeat measurement is needed.","FAST deforms its whole 500 m dish into a single paraboloid when observing.","Before installation fatigue-test sample cables and anchors at 500 MPa stress amplitude for the full two million cycles and inspect for broken wires and anchor cracks."],"answer":2,"explanation":"安裝前抽樣對鋼索與錨具做疲勞試驗，以 500 MPa 應力幅跑滿兩百萬次並檢查斷絲與錨具裂紋；運轉中在代表性主索上裝索力感測器，對每種拋物面位置比較實測索力與有限元素模型；面板出廠前以攝影測量或雷射掃描量面形，安裝後再抽查。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Before installation fatigue-test sample cables and anchors at 500 MPa stress amplitude for the full two million cycles and inspect for broken wires and anchor cracks; in service fit force sensors to representative main cables and compare measured tension with the finite-element model for each paraboloid position; measure panel shape by photogrammetry or laser scanning at the factory and spot-check after installation. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":11},{"id":"a500-v12-12","title":"面板、索網與抗疲勞鋼索：失效診斷","titleEn":"Panels, cable net and fatigue-resistant cables: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-11"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「三角面板、索網節點與促動器」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Triangular panels, cable-net nodes and actuators” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"錨具處的疲勞裂紋或腐蝕使單根主索斷裂，載重重新分配，附近節點位置與面形同時偏移；晴天時鋁面板 11 m × 23 ppm/K × 20 K ≈ 5 mm 的熱伸長若因連接件卡死而無法滑動，面板翹曲，局部面形誤差遠超預算。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Fatigue cracking or corrosion at an anchor breaks a main cable, loads redistribute and nearby node positions and surface shape shift together; on sunny days an aluminium panel grows about 11 m × 23 ppm/K × 20 K ≈ 5 mm, and if seized connectors stop it sliding the panel warps and the local surface error far exceeds budget. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：每次換源都改變拋物面位置，索網反覆承受應力循環；公開資料指出 FAST 的鋼索需承受約 500 MPa 應力幅、兩百萬次循環，約為一般規範的兩倍，因此必須開發新的鋼絞線與錨固工藝。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Every change of source moves the paraboloid, so the net sees repeated stress cycles; public reports state that FAST's cables had to survive about 500 MPa stress amplitude for two million cycles, roughly twice the usual code value, which required new steel-strand and anchorage technology.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「索網只承受靜態重量，不必考慮疲勞壽命。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"The cable net carries only static weight, so fatigue life can be ignored.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-12-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"錨具處的疲勞裂紋或腐蝕使單根主索斷裂，載重重新分配，附近節點位置與面形同時偏移；晴天時鋁面板 11 m × 23 ppm/K × 20 K ≈ 5 mm 的熱伸長若因連接件卡死而無法滑動，面板翹曲，局部面形誤差遠超預算。","textEn":"Fatigue cracking or corrosion at an anchor breaks a main cable, loads redistribute and nearby node positions and surface shape shift together; on sunny days an aluminium panel grows about 11 m × 23 ppm/K × 20 K ≈ 5 mm, and if seized connectors stop it sliding the panel warps and the local surface error far exceeds budget.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-12-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「面板、索網與抗疲勞鋼索」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Panels, cable net and fatigue-resistant cables\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["錨具處的疲勞裂紋或腐蝕使單根主索斷裂，載重重新分配，附近節點位置與面形同時偏移。","異常只出現一次就可以忽略，不需要記錄或追蹤。","只要控制六根鋼索長度，饋源艙就能直接達到毫米級定位。"],"optionsEn":["Fatigue cracking or corrosion at an anchor breaks a main cable, loads redistribute and nearby node positions and surface shape shift together.","An anomaly that appears only once can be ignored without logging or follow-up.","Controlling the six cable lengths alone puts the feed cabin to millimetre accuracy."],"answer":0,"explanation":"錨具處的疲勞裂紋或腐蝕使單根主索斷裂，載重重新分配，附近節點位置與面形同時偏移；晴天時鋁面板 11 m × 23 ppm/K × 20 K ≈ 5 mm 的熱伸長若因連接件卡死而無法滑動，面板翹曲，局部面形誤差遠超預算。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Fatigue cracking or corrosion at an anchor breaks a main cable, loads redistribute and nearby node positions and surface shape shift together; on sunny days an aluminium panel grows about 11 m × 23 ppm/K × 20 K ≈ 5 mm, and if seized connectors stop it sliding the panel warps and the local surface error far exceeds budget. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":3,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":12},{"id":"a500-v12-13","title":"索驅饋源艙的粗精兩級定位：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Two-stage positioning of the cable-driven feed cabin: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-12"],"objective":"說明「六索饋源艙與 Stewart 平台」如何決定FAST 五百公尺口徑球面電波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Six-cable feed cabin and Stewart platform” determines the key performance of “FAST Five-hundred-meter Aperture Spherical Telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"FAST 不用 Arecibo 那種數百噸的剛性饋源平台，而是以六根鋼索經六座約 100 m 高、分布在 600 m 圓周上的塔，懸吊約 30 t 的輕型饋源艙，由絞車收放使艙體在拋物面上方約 140 m、與球面同心的焦面上移動。鋼索會下垂並隨風與索力伸縮，所以索驅並聯機構只能做粗定位（約 0.1 m）；艙內再以 AB 轉軸讓饋源朝向拋物面，並由六自由度 Stewart 平台把殘差修正到約 10 mm。接收機、冷頭與平台都在艙內，訊號經光纖傳到地面。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「六索饋源艙與 Stewart 平台」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Instead of a rigid feed platform weighing hundreds of tonnes like Arecibo's, FAST hangs a light feed cabin of about 30 t from six steel cables running over six towers about 100 m high on a 600 m circle, and winches move it over the focal surface, concentric with the sphere and about 140 m above the paraboloid. The cables sag and stretch with wind and tension, so the cable-driven parallel robot only positions coarsely, to about 0.1 m; inside the cabin an AB rotator points the feed at the paraboloid and a six-degree-of-freedom Stewart platform corrects the residual to about 10 mm. Receivers, cold heads and the platform ride in the cabin and signals reach the ground over optical fibre. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Six-cable feed cabin and Stewart platform”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：懸鏈下垂 s ≈ wL²/(8T)：取教學假設 w = 100 N/m、L = 500 m、T = 200 kN，s ≈ 100 × 250 000/(1.6×10⁶) ≈ 15.6 m；由 δs/s = −δT/T，索力只變 1% 下垂就變 0.16 m，所以單靠索長控制達不到公分級。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Catenary sag s ≈ wL²/(8T): with teaching values w = 100 N/m, L = 500 m and T = 200 kN, s ≈ 100 × 250 000/(1.6×10⁶) ≈ 15.6 m; since δs/s = −δT/T, a 1% tension change moves the sag by 0.16 m, so cable-length control alone cannot reach centimetres.","failure":"常見誤解：「只要控制六根鋼索長度，饋源艙就能直接達到毫米級定位。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Controlling the six cable lengths alone puts the feed cabin to millimetre accuracy.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「六索饋源艙與 Stewart 平台」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Six-cable feed cabin and Stewart platform”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-13-k1","title":"索驅饋源艙的粗精兩級定位","titleEn":"Two-stage positioning of the cable-driven feed cabin","text":"FAST 不用 Arecibo 那種數百噸的剛性饋源平台，而是以六根鋼索經六座約 100 m 高、分布在 600 m 圓周上的塔，懸吊約 30 t 的輕型饋源艙，由絞車收放使艙體在拋物面上方約 140 m、與球面同心的焦面上移動。鋼索會下垂並隨風與索力伸縮，所以索驅並聯機構只能做粗定位（約 0.1 m）；艙內再以 AB 轉軸讓饋源朝向拋物面，並由六自由度 Stewart 平台把殘差修正到約 10 mm。","textEn":"Instead of a rigid feed platform weighing hundreds of tonnes like Arecibo's, FAST hangs a light feed cabin of about 30 t from six steel cables running over six towers about 100 m high on a 600 m circle, and winches move it over the focal surface, concentric with the sphere and about 140 m above the paraboloid. The cables sag and stretch with wind and tension, so the cable-driven parallel robot only positions coarsely, to about 0.1 m; inside the cabin an AB rotator points the feed at the paraboloid and a six-degree-of-freedom Stewart platform corrects the residual to about 10 mm.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-13-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：只要控制六根鋼索長度，饋源艙就能直接達到毫米級定位。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Controlling the six cable lengths alone puts the feed cabin to millimetre accuracy. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「索驅饋源艙的粗精兩級定位」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Two-stage positioning of the cable-driven feed cabin\" is correct?","options":["只要控制六根鋼索長度，饋源艙就能直接達到毫米級定位。","FAST 不用 Arecibo 那種數百噸的剛性饋源平台，而是以六根鋼索經六座約 100 m 高、分布在 600 m 圓周上的塔，懸吊約 30 t 的輕型饋源艙，由絞車收放使艙體在拋物面上方約 140 m、與球面同心的焦面上移動。","5 mm 的面形精度在 500 MHz 與 3 GHz 一樣好。"],"optionsEn":["Controlling the six cable lengths alone puts the feed cabin to millimetre accuracy.","Instead of a rigid feed platform weighing hundreds of tonnes like Arecibo's, FAST hangs a light feed cabin of about 30 t from six steel cables running over six towers about 100 m high on a 600 m circle, and winches move it over the focal surface, concentric with the sphere and about 140 m above the paraboloid.","A 5 mm surface performs equally well at 500 MHz and 3 GHz."],"answer":1,"explanation":"FAST 不用 Arecibo 那種數百噸的剛性饋源平台，而是以六根鋼索經六座約 100 m 高、分布在 600 m 圓周上的塔，懸吊約 30 t 的輕型饋源艙，由絞車收放使艙體在拋物面上方約 140 m、與球面同心的焦面上移動。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Instead of a rigid feed platform weighing hundreds of tonnes like Arecibo's, FAST hangs a light feed cabin of about 30 t from six steel cables running over six towers about 100 m high on a 600 m circle, and winches move it over the focal surface, concentric with the sphere and about 140 m above the paraboloid. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":13},{"id":"a500-v12-14","title":"索驅饋源艙的粗精兩級定位：定量估算","titleEn":"Two-stage positioning of the cable-driven feed cabin: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-13"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「六索饋源艙與 Stewart 平台」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Six-cable feed cabin and Stewart platform” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：懸鏈下垂 s ≈ wL²/(8T)：取教學假設 w = 100 N/m、L = 500 m、T = 200 kN，s ≈ 100 × 250 000/(1.6×10⁶) ≈ 15.6 m；由 δs/s = −δT/T，索力只變 1% 下垂就變 0.16 m，所以單靠索長控制達不到公分級。兩級分工：索驅殘差 100 mm，Stewart 平台壓到 10 mm，需要 10:1 的修正比，且必須以即時量測的艙體位置做閉迴路。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Catenary sag s ≈ wL²/(8T): with teaching values w = 100 N/m, L = 500 m and T = 200 kN, s ≈ 100 × 250 000/(1.6×10⁶) ≈ 15.6 m; since δs/s = −δT/T, a 1% tension change moves the sag by 0.16 m, so cable-length control alone cannot reach centimetres. The two stages divide the work: 100 mm cable-level residual reduced to 10 mm by the Stewart platform, a 10:1 correction that must run in closed loop on measured cabin position. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以全站儀等量測系統同時追蹤艙體與 Stewart 上平台的位置，追蹤觀測時比較指令軌跡與實測軌跡，分別記錄粗級與精級的 rms 殘差及其頻譜；在無風與有風條件各測一次，找出風激低頻擺動的頻率，確認其振幅仍在 Stewart 行程與頻寬之內。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Track both the cabin and the Stewart top plate with total stations and related metrology, compare commanded and measured trajectories during tracking, and log rms residuals and spectra for the coarse and fine stages separately; repeat in calm and windy conditions, identify the frequency of wind-driven low-frequency sway and confirm that its amplitude stays within the Stewart stroke and bandwidth.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-14-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"懸鏈下垂 s ≈ wL²/(8T)：取教學假設 w = 100 N/m、L = 500 m、T = 200 kN，s ≈ 100 × 250 000/(1.6×10⁶) ≈ 15.6 m；由 δs/s = −δT/T，索力只變 1% 下垂就變 0.16 m，所以單靠索長控制達不到公分級。兩級分工：索驅殘差 100 mm，Stewart 平台壓到 10 mm，需要 10:1 的修正比，且必須以即時量測的艙體位置做閉迴路。","textEn":"Catenary sag s ≈ wL²/(8T): with teaching values w = 100 N/m, L = 500 m and T = 200 kN, s ≈ 100 × 250 000/(1.6×10⁶) ≈ 15.6 m; since δs/s = −δT/T, a 1% tension change moves the sag by 0.16 m, so cable-length control alone cannot reach centimetres. The two stages divide the work: 100 mm cable-level residual reduced to 10 mm by the Stewart platform, a 10:1 correction that must run in closed loop on measured cabin position.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-14-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「索驅饋源艙的粗精兩級定位」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Two-stage positioning of the cable-driven feed cabin\", which statement holds?","options":["頻譜基線漣波只來自接收機電子，與望遠鏡幾何無關。","FAST 觀測時會把整個 500 m 反射面變成一個拋物面。","懸鏈下垂 s ≈ wL²/(8T)：取教學假設 w = 100 N/m、L = 500 m、T = 200 kN，s ≈ 100 × 250 000/(1.6×10⁶) ≈ 15.6 m。"],"optionsEn":["Spectral baseline ripple comes only from receiver electronics, not telescope geometry.","FAST deforms its whole 500 m dish into a single paraboloid when observing.","Catenary sag s ≈ wL²/(8T): with teaching values w = 100 N/m, L = 500 m and T = 200 kN, s ≈ 100 × 250 000/(1.6×10⁶) ≈ 15.6 m."],"answer":2,"explanation":"懸鏈下垂 s ≈ wL²/(8T)：取教學假設 w = 100 N/m、L = 500 m、T = 200 kN，s ≈ 100 × 250 000/(1.6×10⁶) ≈ 15.6 m；由 δs/s = −δT/T，索力只變 1% 下垂就變 0.16 m，所以單靠索長控制達不到公分級。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Catenary sag s ≈ wL²/(8T): with teaching values w = 100 N/m, L = 500 m and T = 200 kN, s ≈ 100 × 250 000/(1.6×10⁶) ≈ 15.6 m; since δs/s = −δT/T, a 1% tension change moves the sag by 0.16 m, so cable-length control alone cannot reach centimetres. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":14},{"id":"a500-v12-15","title":"索驅饋源艙的粗精兩級定位：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Two-stage positioning of the cable-driven feed cabin: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-14"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「六索饋源艙與 Stewart 平台」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Six-cable feed cabin and Stewart platform” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以全站儀等量測系統同時追蹤艙體與 Stewart 上平台的位置，追蹤觀測時比較指令軌跡與實測軌跡，分別記錄粗級與精級的 rms 殘差及其頻譜；在無風與有風條件各測一次，找出風激低頻擺動的頻率，確認其振幅仍在 Stewart 行程與頻寬之內。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Track both the cabin and the Stewart top plate with total stations and related metrology, compare commanded and measured trajectories during tracking, and log rms residuals and spectra for the coarse and fine stages separately; repeat in calm and windy conditions, identify the frequency of wind-driven low-frequency sway and confirm that its amplitude stays within the Stewart stroke and bandwidth. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：強風時艙體擺幅超過 Stewart 行程，平台撞到極限後殘差突然跳升，波束在天空中游移，增益隨之調變；若六台絞車不同步，艙體傾斜，AB 轉軸與饋源朝向偏離拋物面中心，照明不對稱、溢出增加。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: In strong wind the cabin sway exceeds the Stewart stroke, the platform hits its limits and the residual jumps, so the beam wanders on the sky and the gain is modulated; if the six winches fall out of step the cabin tilts, the AB rotator and feed no longer face the paraboloid centre, illumination becomes asymmetric and spillover rises.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-15-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以全站儀等量測系統同時追蹤艙體與 Stewart 上平台的位置，追蹤觀測時比較指令軌跡與實測軌跡，分別記錄粗級與精級的 rms 殘差及其頻譜；在無風與有風條件各測一次，找出風激低頻擺動的頻率，確認其振幅仍在 Stewart 行程與頻寬之內。","textEn":"Track both the cabin and the Stewart top plate with total stations and related metrology, compare commanded and measured trajectories during tracking, and log rms residuals and spectra for the coarse and fine stages separately; repeat in calm and windy conditions, identify the frequency of wind-driven low-frequency sway and confirm that its amplitude stays within the Stewart stroke and bandwidth.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-15-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「索驅饋源艙的粗精兩級定位」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Two-stage positioning of the cable-driven feed cabin\"?","options":["以全站儀等量測系統同時追蹤艙體與 Stewart 上平台的位置，追蹤觀測時比較指令軌跡與實測軌跡，分別記錄粗級與精級的 rms 殘差及其頻譜。","不確定度太難估計，報告中只寫最佳值即可。","FAST 反射面固定不動，所以增益與天頂角無關。"],"optionsEn":["Track both the cabin and the Stewart top plate with total stations and related metrology, compare commanded and measured trajectories during tracking, and log rms residuals and spectra for the coarse and fine stages separately.","Uncertainty is too hard to estimate, so the report may state only the best value.","Because FAST's dish never moves, its gain does not depend on zenith angle."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以全站儀等量測系統同時追蹤艙體與 Stewart 上平台的位置，追蹤觀測時比較指令軌跡與實測軌跡，分別記錄粗級與精級的 rms 殘差及其頻譜；在無風與有風條件各測一次，找出風激低頻擺動的頻率，確認其振幅仍在 Stewart 行程與頻寬之內。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Track both the cabin and the Stewart top plate with total stations and related metrology, compare commanded and measured trajectories during tracking, and log rms residuals and spectra for the coarse and fine stages separately; repeat in calm and windy conditions, identify the frequency of wind-driven low-frequency sway and confirm that its amplitude stays within the Stewart stroke and bandwidth. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":15},{"id":"a500-v12-16","title":"索驅饋源艙的粗精兩級定位：失效診斷","titleEn":"Two-stage positioning of the cable-driven feed cabin: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-15"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「六索饋源艙與 Stewart 平台」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Six-cable feed cabin and Stewart platform” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"強風時艙體擺幅超過 Stewart 行程，平台撞到極限後殘差突然跳升，波束在天空中游移，增益隨之調變；若六台絞車不同步，艙體傾斜，AB 轉軸與饋源朝向偏離拋物面中心，照明不對稱、溢出增加。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"In strong wind the cabin sway exceeds the Stewart stroke, the platform hits its limits and the residual jumps, so the beam wanders on the sky and the gain is modulated; if the six winches fall out of step the cabin tilts, the AB rotator and feed no longer face the paraboloid centre, illumination becomes asymmetric and spillover rises. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：接收機、冷頭與平台都在艙內，訊號經光纖傳到地面。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Receivers, cold heads and the platform ride in the cabin and signals reach the ground over optical fibre.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「只要控制六根鋼索長度，饋源艙就能直接達到毫米級定位。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Controlling the six cable lengths alone puts the feed cabin to millimetre accuracy.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-16-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"強風時艙體擺幅超過 Stewart 行程，平台撞到極限後殘差突然跳升，波束在天空中游移，增益隨之調變；若六台絞車不同步，艙體傾斜，AB 轉軸與饋源朝向偏離拋物面中心，照明不對稱、溢出增加。","textEn":"In strong wind the cabin sway exceeds the Stewart stroke, the platform hits its limits and the residual jumps, so the beam wanders on the sky and the gain is modulated; if the six winches fall out of step the cabin tilts, the AB rotator and feed no longer face the paraboloid centre, illumination becomes asymmetric and spillover rises.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-16-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「索驅饋源艙的粗精兩級定位」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Two-stage positioning of the cable-driven feed cabin\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["先更換最貴的零件；只要症狀消失，就代表已找到根因。","強風時艙體擺幅超過 Stewart 行程，平台撞到極限後殘差突然跳升，波束在天空中游移，增益隨之調變。","5 mm 的面形精度在 500 MHz 與 3 GHz 一樣好。"],"optionsEn":["Replace the most expensive part first; if the symptom disappears, the root cause has been found.","In strong wind the cabin sway exceeds the Stewart stroke, the platform hits its limits and the residual jumps, so the beam wanders on the sky and the gain is modulated.","A 5 mm surface performs equally well at 500 MHz and 3 GHz."],"answer":1,"explanation":"強風時艙體擺幅超過 Stewart 行程，平台撞到極限後殘差突然跳升，波束在天空中游移，增益隨之調變；若六台絞車不同步，艙體傾斜，AB 轉軸與饋源朝向偏離拋物面中心，照明不對稱、溢出增加。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"In strong wind the cabin sway exceeds the Stewart stroke, the platform hits its limits and the residual jumps, so the beam wanders on the sky and the gain is modulated; if the six winches fall out of step the cabin tilts, the AB rotator and feed no longer face the paraboloid centre, illumination becomes asymmetric and spillover rises. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":4,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":16}],"order":2},{"id":"a500-v12-s3","title":"量測、校正與誤差預算","titleEn":"Measurement, calibration and error budgets","description":"本階段聚焦「面形量測、閉迴路控制與 Ruze 預算」與「指向校正與饋源橫向誤差」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"Surface metrology, closed-loop control and the Ruze budget\" and \"Pointing calibration and lateral feed error\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a500-v12-17","title":"面形量測、閉迴路控制與 Ruze 預算：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Surface metrology, closed-loop control and the Ruze budget: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-16"],"objective":"說明「節點靶標、基準墩與全站儀」如何決定FAST 五百公尺口徑球面電波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Node targets, base pillars and total stations” determines the key performance of “FAST Five-hundred-meter Aperture Spherical Telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"拋物面靠閉迴路維持：索網節點上的靶標由架設在基準墩網上的雷射全站儀量測，基準點相對精度約 1 mm；量到的節點位置與目標拋物面比較後修正促動器，設計面形精度 5 mm rms，節點量測與控制各約 2 mm，並要求約一分鐘內量完上千個節點。總面形誤差來自面板製造、面板曲率失配、節點定位、量測與熱和風，各項以均方根相加；Ruze 效率損失隨頻率急遽上升，所以最高頻段（3 GHz）決定整個預算。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「節點靶標、基準墩與全站儀」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The paraboloid is held in closed loop: targets on the cable-net nodes are surveyed by laser total stations on a network of base pillars with about 1 mm relative accuracy, and measured node positions are compared with the target paraboloid to correct the actuators. The design calls for 5 mm rms surface accuracy, about 2 mm each for node measurement and control, and more than a thousand nodes surveyed in about a minute. Total surface error combines panel manufacture, panel curvature mismatch, node positioning, measurement, and thermal and wind effects in root-sum-square; Ruze efficiency loss rises steeply with frequency, so the highest band, 3 GHz, drives the whole budget. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Node targets, base pillars and total stations”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：教學預算：面板製造 2.5 mm、曲率失配 2.0 mm、節點定位 2.0 mm、量測 1.5 mm、熱與風 1.5 mm，RSS = √18.75 = 4.33 mm \u003c 5 mm。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Teaching budget: panel manufacture 2.5 mm, curvature mismatch 2.0 mm, node positioning 2.0 mm, measurement 1.5 mm, thermal and wind 1.5 mm, giving RSS = √18.75 = 4.33 mm \u003c 5 mm.","failure":"常見誤解：「5 mm 的面形精度在 500 MHz 與 3 GHz 一樣好。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A 5 mm surface performs equally well at 500 MHz and 3 GHz.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「節點靶標、基準墩與全站儀」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Node targets, base pillars and total stations”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-17-k1","title":"面形量測、閉迴路控制與 Ruze 預算","titleEn":"Surface metrology, closed-loop control and the Ruze budget","text":"拋物面靠閉迴路維持：索網節點上的靶標由架設在基準墩網上的雷射全站儀量測，基準點相對精度約 1 mm；量到的節點位置與目標拋物面比較後修正促動器，設計面形精度 5 mm rms，節點量測與控制各約 2 mm，並要求約一分鐘內量完上千個節點。總面形誤差來自面板製造、面板曲率失配、節點定位、量測與熱和風，各項以均方根相加；Ruze 效率損失隨頻率急遽上升，所以最高頻段（3 GHz）決定整個預算。","textEn":"The paraboloid is held in closed loop: targets on the cable-net nodes are surveyed by laser total stations on a network of base pillars with about 1 mm relative accuracy, and measured node positions are compared with the target paraboloid to correct the actuators. The design calls for 5 mm rms surface accuracy, about 2 mm each for node measurement and control, and more than a thousand nodes surveyed in about a minute.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-17-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：5 mm 的面形精度在 500 MHz 與 3 GHz 一樣好。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A 5 mm surface performs equally well at 500 MHz and 3 GHz. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「面形量測、閉迴路控制與 Ruze 預算」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Surface metrology, closed-loop control and the Ruze budget\" is correct?","options":["5 mm 的面形精度在 500 MHz 與 3 GHz 一樣好。","相對 140 m 焦距，10 mm 的饋源誤差可以忽略。","拋物面靠閉迴路維持：索網節點上的靶標由架設在基準墩網上的雷射全站儀量測，基準點相對精度約 1 mm。"],"optionsEn":["A 5 mm surface performs equally well at 500 MHz and 3 GHz.","A 10 mm feed error is negligible against a 140 m focal length.","The paraboloid is held in closed loop: targets on the cable-net nodes are surveyed by laser total stations on a network of base pillars with about 1 mm relative accuracy, and measured node positions are compared with the target paraboloid to correct the actuators."],"answer":2,"explanation":"拋物面靠閉迴路維持：索網節點上的靶標由架設在基準墩網上的雷射全站儀量測，基準點相對精度約 1 mm；量到的節點位置與目標拋物面比較後修正促動器，設計面形精度 5 mm rms，節點量測與控制各約 2 mm，並要求約一分鐘內量完上千個節點。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The paraboloid is held in closed loop: targets on the cable-net nodes are surveyed by laser total stations on a network of base pillars with about 1 mm relative accuracy, and measured node positions are compared with the target paraboloid to correct the actuators. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":17},{"id":"a500-v12-18","title":"面形量測、閉迴路控制與 Ruze 預算：定量估算","titleEn":"Surface metrology, closed-loop control and the Ruze budget: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-17"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「節點靶標、基準墩與全站儀」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Node targets, base pillars and total stations” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：教學預算：面板製造 2.5 mm、曲率失配 2.0 mm、節點定位 2.0 mm、量測 1.5 mm、熱與風 1.5 mm，RSS = √18.75 = 4.33 mm \u003c 5 mm。Ruze η = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]：1.4 GHz（λ = 0.214 m）為 0.937、3 GHz（λ = 0.0999 m）為 0.743；若 ε 剛好 5 mm，分別為 0.917 與 0.674。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Teaching budget: panel manufacture 2.5 mm, curvature mismatch 2.0 mm, node positioning 2.0 mm, measurement 1.5 mm, thermal and wind 1.5 mm, giving RSS = √18.75 = 4.33 mm \u003c 5 mm. Ruze η = exp[−(4πε/λ)²] is 0.937 at 1.4 GHz (λ = 0.214 m) and 0.743 at 3 GHz (λ = 0.0999 m); at exactly ε = 5 mm they become 0.917 and 0.674. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：對同一組節點重複量測，求量測重複性與閉迴路殘差分佈；以冗餘量測（不同測站看同一靶標）檢查大氣折射造成的系統偏差，白天與夜間分開統計；在電波端量不同頻率的口徑效率並擬合 Ruze 曲線，反推等效 ε 與幾何量測結果比對。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Re-survey the same node set to obtain measurement repeatability and the closed-loop residual distribution; use redundant sightings of one target from different stations to expose systematic bias from atmospheric refraction, with day and night statistics kept separate; at radio frequencies measure aperture efficiency across bands, fit the Ruze curve and compare the inferred effective ε with the geometric survey.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-18-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"教學預算：面板製造 2.5 mm、曲率失配 2.0 mm、節點定位 2.0 mm、量測 1.5 mm、熱與風 1.5 mm，RSS = √18.75 = 4.33 mm \u003c 5 mm。Ruze η = exp[−(4πε/λ)²]：1.4 GHz（λ = 0.214 m）為 0.937、3 GHz（λ = 0.0999 m）為 0.743；若 ε 剛好 5 mm，分別為 0.917 與 0.674。","textEn":"Teaching budget: panel manufacture 2.5 mm, curvature mismatch 2.0 mm, node positioning 2.0 mm, measurement 1.5 mm, thermal and wind 1.5 mm, giving RSS = √18.75 = 4.33 mm \u003c 5 mm. Ruze η = exp[−(4πε/λ)²] is 0.937 at 1.4 GHz (λ = 0.214 m) and 0.743 at 3 GHz (λ = 0.0999 m); at exactly ε = 5 mm they become 0.917 and 0.674.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-18-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「面形量測、閉迴路控制與 Ruze 預算」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Surface metrology, closed-loop control and the Ruze budget\", which statement holds?","options":["教學預算：面板製造 2.5 mm、曲率失配 2.0 mm、節點定位 2.0 mm、量測 1.5 mm、熱與風 1.5 mm，RSS = √18.75 = 4.33 mm \u003c 5 mm。","電波寧靜區可以擋掉所有干擾，包括衛星訊號。","FAST 反射面固定不動，所以增益與天頂角無關。"],"optionsEn":["Teaching budget: panel manufacture 2.5 mm, curvature mismatch 2.0 mm, node positioning 2.0 mm, measurement 1.5 mm, thermal and wind 1.5 mm, giving RSS = √18.75 = 4.33 mm \u003c 5 mm.","A radio quiet zone blocks all interference, satellite signals included.","Because FAST's dish never moves, its gain does not depend on zenith angle."],"answer":0,"explanation":"教學預算：面板製造 2.5 mm、曲率失配 2.0 mm、節點定位 2.0 mm、量測 1.5 mm、熱與風 1.5 mm，RSS = √18.75 = 4.33 mm \u003c 5 mm。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Teaching budget: panel manufacture 2.5 mm, curvature mismatch 2.0 mm, node positioning 2.0 mm, measurement 1.5 mm, thermal and wind 1.5 mm, giving RSS = √18.75 = 4.33 mm \u003c 5 mm. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":18},{"id":"a500-v12-19","title":"面形量測、閉迴路控制與 Ruze 預算：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Surface metrology, closed-loop control and the Ruze budget: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-18"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「節點靶標、基準墩與全站儀」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Node targets, base pillars and total stations” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"對同一組節點重複量測，求量測重複性與閉迴路殘差分佈；以冗餘量測（不同測站看同一靶標）檢查大氣折射造成的系統偏差，白天與夜間分開統計；在電波端量不同頻率的口徑效率並擬合 Ruze 曲線，反推等效 ε 與幾何量測結果比對。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Re-survey the same node set to obtain measurement repeatability and the closed-loop residual distribution; use redundant sightings of one target from different stations to expose systematic bias from atmospheric refraction, with day and night statistics kept separate; at radio frequencies measure aperture efficiency across bands, fit the Ruze curve and compare the inferred effective ε with the geometric survey. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：地表附近的溫度梯度使全站儀視線彎曲，節點高度帶有系統誤差，閉迴路反而把這個誤差「修」進面形；若多出 3 mm，ε 由 4.33 mm 升到 √(4.33² + 3²) ≈ 5.27 mm，3 GHz 效率由 0.74 掉到 0.64，損失約 13%。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Temperature gradients near the ground bend total-station sight lines so node heights carry a systematic error, and the closed loop dutifully writes it into the surface; an extra 3 mm raises ε from 4.33 mm to √(4.33² + 3²) ≈ 5.27 mm and cuts the 3 GHz efficiency from 0.74 to 0.64, a loss of about 13%.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-19-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"對同一組節點重複量測，求量測重複性與閉迴路殘差分佈；以冗餘量測（不同測站看同一靶標）檢查大氣折射造成的系統偏差，白天與夜間分開統計；在電波端量不同頻率的口徑效率並擬合 Ruze 曲線，反推等效 ε 與幾何量測結果比對。","textEn":"Re-survey the same node set to obtain measurement repeatability and the closed-loop residual distribution; use redundant sightings of one target from different stations to expose systematic bias from atmospheric refraction, with day and night statistics kept separate; at radio frequencies measure aperture efficiency across bands, fit the Ruze curve and compare the inferred effective ε with the geometric survey.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-19-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「面形量測、閉迴路控制與 Ruze 預算」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Surface metrology, closed-loop control and the Ruze budget\"?","options":["允收準則可以等看到量測數據後再決定。","對同一組節點重複量測，求量測重複性與閉迴路殘差分佈。","索網只承受靜態重量，不必考慮疲勞壽命。"],"optionsEn":["Acceptance criteria can be decided after the measured data have been seen.","Re-survey the same node set to obtain measurement repeatability and the closed-loop residual distribution.","The cable net carries only static weight, so fatigue life can be ignored."],"answer":1,"explanation":"對同一組節點重複量測，求量測重複性與閉迴路殘差分佈；以冗餘量測（不同測站看同一靶標）檢查大氣折射造成的系統偏差，白天與夜間分開統計；在電波端量不同頻率的口徑效率並擬合 Ruze 曲線，反推等效 ε 與幾何量測結果比對。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Re-survey the same node set to obtain measurement repeatability and the closed-loop residual distribution; use redundant sightings of one target from different stations to expose systematic bias from atmospheric refraction, with day and night statistics kept separate; at radio frequencies measure aperture efficiency across bands, fit the Ruze curve and compare the inferred effective ε with the geometric survey. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":19},{"id":"a500-v12-20","title":"面形量測、閉迴路控制與 Ruze 預算：失效診斷","titleEn":"Surface metrology, closed-loop control and the Ruze budget: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-19"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「節點靶標、基準墩與全站儀」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Node targets, base pillars and total stations” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"地表附近的溫度梯度使全站儀視線彎曲，節點高度帶有系統誤差，閉迴路反而把這個誤差「修」進面形；若多出 3 mm，ε 由 4.33 mm 升到 √(4.33² + 3²) ≈ 5.27 mm，3 GHz 效率由 0.74 掉到 0.64，損失約 13%。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Temperature gradients near the ground bend total-station sight lines so node heights carry a systematic error, and the closed loop dutifully writes it into the surface; an extra 3 mm raises ε from 4.33 mm to √(4.33² + 3²) ≈ 5.27 mm and cuts the 3 GHz efficiency from 0.74 to 0.64, a loss of about 13%. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：總面形誤差來自面板製造、面板曲率失配、節點定位、量測與熱和風，各項以均方根相加；Ruze 效率損失隨頻率急遽上升，所以最高頻段（3 GHz）決定整個預算。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Total surface error combines panel manufacture, panel curvature mismatch, node positioning, measurement, and thermal and wind effects in root-sum-square; Ruze efficiency loss rises steeply with frequency, so the highest band, 3 GHz, drives the whole budget.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「5 mm 的面形精度在 500 MHz 與 3 GHz 一樣好。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A 5 mm surface performs equally well at 500 MHz and 3 GHz.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-20-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"地表附近的溫度梯度使全站儀視線彎曲，節點高度帶有系統誤差，閉迴路反而把這個誤差「修」進面形；若多出 3 mm，ε 由 4.33 mm 升到 √(4.33² + 3²) ≈ 5.27 mm，3 GHz 效率由 0.74 掉到 0.64，損失約 13%。","textEn":"Temperature gradients near the ground bend total-station sight lines so node heights carry a systematic error, and the closed loop dutifully writes it into the surface; an extra 3 mm raises ε from 4.33 mm to √(4.33² + 3²) ≈ 5.27 mm and cuts the 3 GHz efficiency from 0.74 to 0.64, a loss of about 13%.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-20-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「面形量測、閉迴路控制與 Ruze 預算」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Surface metrology, closed-loop control and the Ruze budget\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["症狀相同就代表原因相同，不必用量測區分。","相對 140 m 焦距，10 mm 的饋源誤差可以忽略。","地表附近的溫度梯度使全站儀視線彎曲，節點高度帶有系統誤差，閉迴路反而把這個誤差「修」進面形。"],"optionsEn":["Identical symptoms always mean identical causes, so no discriminating measurement is needed.","A 10 mm feed error is negligible against a 140 m focal length.","Temperature gradients near the ground bend total-station sight lines so node heights carry a systematic error, and the closed loop dutifully writes it into the surface."],"answer":2,"explanation":"地表附近的溫度梯度使全站儀視線彎曲，節點高度帶有系統誤差，閉迴路反而把這個誤差「修」進面形；若多出 3 mm，ε 由 4.33 mm 升到 √(4.33² + 3²) ≈ 5.27 mm，3 GHz 效率由 0.74 掉到 0.64，損失約 13%。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Temperature gradients near the ground bend total-station sight lines so node heights carry a systematic error, and the closed loop dutifully writes it into the surface; an extra 3 mm raises ε from 4.33 mm to √(4.33² + 3²) ≈ 5.27 mm and cuts the 3 GHz efficiency from 0.74 to 0.64, a loss of about 13%. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":5,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":20},{"id":"a500-v12-21","title":"指向校正與饋源橫向誤差：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Pointing calibration and lateral feed error: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-20"],"objective":"說明「指向模型與饋源位置量測」如何決定FAST 五百公尺口徑球面電波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Pointing model and feed-position metrology” determines the key performance of “FAST Five-hundred-meter Aperture Spherical Telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"FAST 的波束方向由拋物面頂點與饋源相位中心的連線決定；饋源橫向偏移 Δx 會讓波束偏轉 BDF·Δx/F，其中波束偏折因子 BDF 對 f/D = 0.4665 約為 0.86。指向誤差來源包括饋源位置量測誤差、拋物面軸向誤差、接收機相位中心偏移與時間同步。校正方法是對致密校準源做十字掃描或漂移掃描，擬合高斯偏移量，建立以方位與天頂角為變數的指向模型並修正；試運行報告的指向精度為 7.9″ rms，相對 L 波段約 2.9′ 的半功率波束寬。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「指向模型與饋源位置量測」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"FAST's beam direction is set by the line from the paraboloid vertex through the feed phase centre, so a lateral feed offset Δx tilts the beam by BDF·Δx/F, where the beam deviation factor BDF is about 0.86 for f/D = 0.4665. Pointing errors come from feed-position metrology, paraboloid-axis error, receiver phase-centre offset and timing. Calibration uses cross scans or drift scans over compact calibrators, fits Gaussian offsets and builds a pointing model in azimuth and zenith angle; commissioning reported 7.9″ rms pointing against a half-power beamwidth of about 2.9′ at L band. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Pointing model and feed-position metrology”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：BDF ≈ [1 + 0.36(D/4F)²]/[1 + (D/4F)²]，D/4F = 0.536，BDF ≈ 0.857。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: BDF ≈ [1 + 0.36(D/4F)²]/[1 + (D/4F)²] with D/4F = 0.536 gives BDF ≈ 0.857.","failure":"常見誤解：「相對 140 m 焦距，10 mm 的饋源誤差可以忽略。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A 10 mm feed error is negligible against a 140 m focal length.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「指向模型與饋源位置量測」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Pointing model and feed-position metrology”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-21-k1","title":"指向校正與饋源橫向誤差","titleEn":"Pointing calibration and lateral feed error","text":"FAST 的波束方向由拋物面頂點與饋源相位中心的連線決定；饋源橫向偏移 Δx 會讓波束偏轉 BDF·Δx/F，其中波束偏折因子 BDF 對 f/D = 0.4665 約為 0.86。指向誤差來源包括饋源位置量測誤差、拋物面軸向誤差、接收機相位中心偏移與時間同步。","textEn":"FAST's beam direction is set by the line from the paraboloid vertex through the feed phase centre, so a lateral feed offset Δx tilts the beam by BDF·Δx/F, where the beam deviation factor BDF is about 0.86 for f/D = 0.4665. Pointing errors come from feed-position metrology, paraboloid-axis error, receiver phase-centre offset and timing.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-21-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：相對 140 m 焦距，10 mm 的饋源誤差可以忽略。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A 10 mm feed error is negligible against a 140 m focal length. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「指向校正與饋源橫向誤差」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Pointing calibration and lateral feed error\" is correct?","options":["FAST 的波束方向由拋物面頂點與饋源相位中心的連線決定。","相對 140 m 焦距，10 mm 的饋源誤差可以忽略。","頻譜基線漣波只來自接收機電子，與望遠鏡幾何無關。"],"optionsEn":["FAST's beam direction is set by the line from the paraboloid vertex through the feed phase centre, so a lateral feed offset Δx tilts the beam by BDF·Δx/F, where the beam deviation factor BDF is about 0.86 for f/D = 0.4665.","A 10 mm feed error is negligible against a 140 m focal length.","Spectral baseline ripple comes only from receiver electronics, not telescope geometry."],"answer":0,"explanation":"FAST 的波束方向由拋物面頂點與饋源相位中心的連線決定；饋源橫向偏移 Δx 會讓波束偏轉 BDF·Δx/F，其中波束偏折因子 BDF 對 f/D = 0.4665 約為 0.86。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"FAST's beam direction is set by the line from the paraboloid vertex through the feed phase centre, so a lateral feed offset Δx tilts the beam by BDF·Δx/F, where the beam deviation factor BDF is about 0.86 for f/D = 0.4665. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":21},{"id":"a500-v12-22","title":"指向校正與饋源橫向誤差：定量估算","titleEn":"Pointing calibration and lateral feed error: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-21"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「指向模型與饋源位置量測」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Pointing model and feed-position metrology” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：BDF ≈ [1 + 0.36(D/4F)²]/[1 + (D/4F)²]，D/4F = 0.536，BDF ≈ 0.857。Δx = 10 mm 時 Δθ = 0.857 × 0.010/139.95 = 6.1×10⁻⁵ rad = 12.6″；5 mm 為 6.3″。高斯波束增益損失 1 − exp[−4ln2·(Δθ/HPBW)²]：7.9″ 為 0.57%、12.6″ 為 1.4%、30″ 為 7.9%。若饋源項只分配 4″，橫向隨機誤差須 ≲ 3.2 mm。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: BDF ≈ [1 + 0.36(D/4F)²]/[1 + (D/4F)²] with D/4F = 0.536 gives BDF ≈ 0.857. For Δx = 10 mm, Δθ = 0.857 × 0.010/139.95 = 6.1×10⁻⁵ rad = 12.6″, and 6.3″ for 5 mm. Gaussian-beam gain loss 1 − exp[−4ln2·(Δθ/HPBW)²] is 0.57% at 7.9″, 1.4% at 12.6″ and 7.9% at 30″. If the feed term is allotted only 4″, the random lateral error must be ≲ 3.2 mm. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：在不同方位、天頂角、白天與夜間對校準源做十字掃描，擬合每次的偏移量並求殘差 rms；把殘差與同時刻量到的饋源位置殘差、氣溫做相關，找出可寫進模型的系統項；再用 19 個波束對同一源做映射，確認各波束的相對位置與設計幾何一致。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Cross-scan calibrators over azimuth, zenith angle, day and night, fit each offset and compute the residual rms; correlate residuals with simultaneously measured feed-position residuals and air temperature to find systematic terms that belong in the model; then map one source with all 19 beams and confirm their relative positions match the design geometry.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-22-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"BDF ≈ [1 + 0.36(D/4F)²]/[1 + (D/4F)²]，D/4F = 0.536，BDF ≈ 0.857。Δx = 10 mm 時 Δθ = 0.857 × 0.010/139.95 = 6.1×10⁻⁵ rad = 12.6″；5 mm 為 6.3″。高斯波束增益損失 1 − exp[−4ln2·(Δθ/HPBW)²]：7.9″ 為 0.57%、12.6″ 為 1.4%、30″ 為 7.9%。若饋源項只分配 4″，橫向隨機誤差須 ≲ 3.2 mm。","textEn":"BDF ≈ [1 + 0.36(D/4F)²]/[1 + (D/4F)²] with D/4F = 0.536 gives BDF ≈ 0.857. For Δx = 10 mm, Δθ = 0.857 × 0.010/139.95 = 6.1×10⁻⁵ rad = 12.6″, and 6.3″ for 5 mm. Gaussian-beam gain loss 1 − exp[−4ln2·(Δθ/HPBW)²] is 0.57% at 7.9″, 1.4% at 12.6″ and 7.9% at 30″. If the feed term is allotted only 4″, the random lateral error must be ≲ 3.2 mm.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-22-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「指向校正與饋源橫向誤差」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Pointing calibration and lateral feed error\", which statement holds?","options":["FAST 觀測時會把整個 500 m 反射面變成一個拋物面。","BDF ≈ [1 + 0.36(D/4F)²]/[1 + (D/4F)²]，D/4F = 0.536，BDF ≈ 0.857。","索網只承受靜態重量，不必考慮疲勞壽命。"],"optionsEn":["FAST deforms its whole 500 m dish into a single paraboloid when observing.","BDF ≈ [1 + 0.36(D/4F)²]/[1 + (D/4F)²] with D/4F = 0.536 gives BDF ≈ 0.857.","The cable net carries only static weight, so fatigue life can be ignored."],"answer":1,"explanation":"BDF ≈ [1 + 0.36(D/4F)²]/[1 + (D/4F)²]，D/4F = 0.536，BDF ≈ 0.857。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"BDF ≈ [1 + 0.36(D/4F)²]/[1 + (D/4F)²] with D/4F = 0.536 gives BDF ≈ 0.857. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":22},{"id":"a500-v12-23","title":"指向校正與饋源橫向誤差：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Pointing calibration and lateral feed error: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-22"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「指向模型與饋源位置量測」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Pointing model and feed-position metrology” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"在不同方位、天頂角、白天與夜間對校準源做十字掃描，擬合每次的偏移量並求殘差 rms；把殘差與同時刻量到的饋源位置殘差、氣溫做相關，找出可寫進模型的系統項；再用 19 個波束對同一源做映射，確認各波束的相對位置與設計幾何一致。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Cross-scan calibrators over azimuth, zenith angle, day and night, fit each offset and compute the residual rms; correlate residuals with simultaneously measured feed-position residuals and air temperature to find systematic terms that belong in the model; then map one source with all 19 beams and confirm their relative positions match the design geometry. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：指向模型只在夜間建立，白天日照讓塔架與鋼索熱變形，產生數十角秒的系統偏移；若全站儀座標系與電波相位中心之間有未校正的固定偏差，HI 拼接圖錯位，脈衝星計時觀測的流量也被系統性低估。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: A pointing model built only at night meets daytime solar heating of towers and cables that adds systematic offsets of tens of arcseconds; an uncorrected fixed offset between the total-station frame and the radio phase centre misregisters HI mosaics and systematically lowers the flux recorded in pulsar-timing sessions.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-23-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"在不同方位、天頂角、白天與夜間對校準源做十字掃描，擬合每次的偏移量並求殘差 rms；把殘差與同時刻量到的饋源位置殘差、氣溫做相關，找出可寫進模型的系統項；再用 19 個波束對同一源做映射，確認各波束的相對位置與設計幾何一致。","textEn":"Cross-scan calibrators over azimuth, zenith angle, day and night, fit each offset and compute the residual rms; correlate residuals with simultaneously measured feed-position residuals and air temperature to find systematic terms that belong in the model; then map one source with all 19 beams and confirm their relative positions match the design geometry.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-23-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「指向校正與饋源橫向誤差」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Pointing calibration and lateral feed error\"?","options":["只要模擬結果看起來合理，就可以省略實體量測與校正。","只要控制六根鋼索長度，饋源艙就能直接達到毫米級定位。","在不同方位、天頂角、白天與夜間對校準源做十字掃描，擬合每次的偏移量並求殘差 rms。"],"optionsEn":["If the simulation looks reasonable, physical measurement and calibration can be skipped.","Controlling the six cable lengths alone puts the feed cabin to millimetre accuracy.","Cross-scan calibrators over azimuth, zenith angle, day and night, fit each offset and compute the residual rms."],"answer":2,"explanation":"在不同方位、天頂角、白天與夜間對校準源做十字掃描，擬合每次的偏移量並求殘差 rms；把殘差與同時刻量到的饋源位置殘差、氣溫做相關，找出可寫進模型的系統項；再用 19 個波束對同一源做映射，確認各波束的相對位置與設計幾何一致。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Cross-scan calibrators over azimuth, zenith angle, day and night, fit each offset and compute the residual rms; correlate residuals with simultaneously measured feed-position residuals and air temperature to find systematic terms that belong in the model; then map one source with all 19 beams and confirm their relative positions match the design geometry. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":23},{"id":"a500-v12-24","title":"指向校正與饋源橫向誤差：失效診斷","titleEn":"Pointing calibration and lateral feed error: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-23"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「指向模型與饋源位置量測」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Pointing model and feed-position metrology” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"指向模型只在夜間建立，白天日照讓塔架與鋼索熱變形，產生數十角秒的系統偏移；若全站儀座標系與電波相位中心之間有未校正的固定偏差，HI 拼接圖錯位，脈衝星計時觀測的流量也被系統性低估。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"A pointing model built only at night meets daytime solar heating of towers and cables that adds systematic offsets of tens of arcseconds; an uncorrected fixed offset between the total-station frame and the radio phase centre misregisters HI mosaics and systematically lowers the flux recorded in pulsar-timing sessions. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：校正方法是對致密校準源做十字掃描或漂移掃描，擬合高斯偏移量，建立以方位與天頂角為變數的指向模型並修正；試運行報告的指向精度為 7.9″ rms，相對 L 波段約 2.9′ 的半功率波束寬。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Calibration uses cross scans or drift scans over compact calibrators, fits Gaussian offsets and builds a pointing model in azimuth and zenith angle; commissioning reported 7.9″ rms pointing against a half-power beamwidth of about 2.9′ at L band.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「相對 140 m 焦距，10 mm 的饋源誤差可以忽略。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A 10 mm feed error is negligible against a 140 m focal length.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-24-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"指向模型只在夜間建立，白天日照讓塔架與鋼索熱變形，產生數十角秒的系統偏移；若全站儀座標系與電波相位中心之間有未校正的固定偏差，HI 拼接圖錯位，脈衝星計時觀測的流量也被系統性低估。","textEn":"A pointing model built only at night meets daytime solar heating of towers and cables that adds systematic offsets of tens of arcseconds; an uncorrected fixed offset between the total-station frame and the radio phase centre misregisters HI mosaics and systematically lowers the flux recorded in pulsar-timing sessions.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-24-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「指向校正與饋源橫向誤差」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Pointing calibration and lateral feed error\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["指向模型只在夜間建立，白天日照讓塔架與鋼索熱變形，產生數十角秒的系統偏移。","只要重新開機或重設軟體，硬體失效也會一併排除。","頻譜基線漣波只來自接收機電子，與望遠鏡幾何無關。"],"optionsEn":["A pointing model built only at night meets daytime solar heating of towers and cables that adds systematic offsets of tens of arcseconds.","Restarting or resetting the software also clears hardware failures.","Spectral baseline ripple comes only from receiver electronics, not telescope geometry."],"answer":0,"explanation":"指向模型只在夜間建立，白天日照讓塔架與鋼索熱變形，產生數十角秒的系統偏移；若全站儀座標系與電波相位中心之間有未校正的固定偏差，HI 拼接圖錯位，脈衝星計時觀測的流量也被系統性低估。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"A pointing model built only at night meets daytime solar heating of towers and cables that adds systematic offsets of tens of arcseconds; an uncorrected fixed offset between the total-station frame and the radio phase centre misregisters HI mosaics and systematically lowers the flux recorded in pulsar-timing sessions. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":6,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":24}],"order":3},{"id":"a500-v12-s4","title":"系統整合、驗證與工程交接","titleEn":"Integration, validation and engineering handoff","description":"本階段聚焦「19 波束接收、雜訊注入與駐波基線」與「電波寧靜區、試運行驗收與交接」：先建立機制與定量模型，再設計驗證並診斷失效。","descriptionEn":"This stage covers \"19-beam reception, noise injection and standing-wave baselines\" and \"Radio quiet zone, commissioning acceptance and handoff\": build the mechanism and quantitative model first, then design verification and diagnose failures.","steps":[{"id":"a500-v12-25","title":"19 波束接收、雜訊注入與駐波基線：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"19-beam reception, noise injection and standing-wave baselines: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-24"],"objective":"說明「19 波束 L 波段接收機」如何決定FAST 五百公尺口徑球面電波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “19-beam L-band receiver” determines the key performance of “FAST Five-hundred-meter Aperture Spherical Telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"焦面上以六角排列 19 個饋喇叭，涵蓋 1.05–1.45 GHz、雙線偏振，低雜訊放大器低溫冷卻，中心波束在 ζ \u003c 26.4° 時 T_sys \u003c 24 K；外圈波束偏離光軸，增益略低並帶彗形。強度校正靠週期性注入雜訊二極體，把計數換成溫度，再乘上 K/Jy 增益曲線。饋源與反射面相距約 140 m，兩者間的多次反射形成週期 c/2h 的駐波漣波，尺度與 HI 星系譜線寬度相當。漂移掃描利用地球自轉，多波束讓巡天速度提高約 19 倍。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「19 波束 L 波段接收機」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"Nineteen feed horns in a hexagonal layout sit at the focal plane covering 1.05–1.45 GHz in dual linear polarisation with cryogenically cooled low-noise amplifiers, and the central beam reaches T_sys \u003c 24 K for ζ \u003c 26.4°; outer beams sit off axis with slightly lower gain and some coma. Intensity calibration injects a noise diode periodically to convert counts to kelvin and then applies the K/Jy gain curve. The feed sits about 140 m from the reflector and multiple reflections between them create a standing-wave ripple of period c/2h, on the same scale as HI galaxy line widths. Drift scans use Earth rotation, and the multibeam raises survey speed about nineteenfold. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “19-beam L-band receiver”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：駐波週期 Δν = c/(2h) = 3×10⁸/(2 × 140) ≈ 1.07 MHz；200 km/s 的 HI 線寬在 1420.4 MHz 為 0.95 MHz，兩者同量級。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Standing-wave period Δν = c/(2h) = 3×10⁸/(2 × 140) ≈ 1.07 MHz, while a 200 km/s HI line at 1420.4 MHz is 0.95 MHz wide, the same scale.","failure":"常見誤解：「頻譜基線漣波只來自接收機電子，與望遠鏡幾何無關。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"Spectral baseline ripple comes only from receiver electronics, not telescope geometry.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「19 波束 L 波段接收機」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “19-beam L-band receiver”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-25-k1","title":"19 波束接收、雜訊注入與駐波基線","titleEn":"19-beam reception, noise injection and standing-wave baselines","text":"焦面上以六角排列 19 個饋喇叭，涵蓋 1.05–1.45 GHz、雙線偏振，低雜訊放大器低溫冷卻，中心波束在 ζ \u003c 26.4° 時 T_sys \u003c 24 K；外圈波束偏離光軸，增益略低並帶彗形。強度校正靠週期性注入雜訊二極體，把計數換成溫度，再乘上 K/Jy 增益曲線。","textEn":"Nineteen feed horns in a hexagonal layout sit at the focal plane covering 1.05–1.45 GHz in dual linear polarisation with cryogenically cooled low-noise amplifiers, and the central beam reaches T_sys \u003c 24 K for ζ \u003c 26.4°; outer beams sit off axis with slightly lower gain and some coma. Intensity calibration injects a noise diode periodically to convert counts to kelvin and then applies the K/Jy gain curve.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-25-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：頻譜基線漣波只來自接收機電子，與望遠鏡幾何無關。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: Spectral baseline ripple comes only from receiver electronics, not telescope geometry. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「19 波束接收、雜訊注入與駐波基線」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"19-beam reception, noise injection and standing-wave baselines\" is correct?","options":["頻譜基線漣波只來自接收機電子，與望遠鏡幾何無關。","焦面上以六角排列 19 個饋喇叭，涵蓋 1.05–1.45 GHz、雙線偏振，低雜訊放大器低溫冷卻，中心波束在 ζ \u003c 26.4° 時 T_sys \u003c 24 K。","電波寧靜區可以擋掉所有干擾，包括衛星訊號。"],"optionsEn":["Spectral baseline ripple comes only from receiver electronics, not telescope geometry.","Nineteen feed horns in a hexagonal layout sit at the focal plane covering 1.05–1.45 GHz in dual linear polarisation with cryogenically cooled low-noise amplifiers, and the central beam reaches T_sys \u003c 24 K for ζ \u003c 26.4°.","A radio quiet zone blocks all interference, satellite signals included."],"answer":1,"explanation":"焦面上以六角排列 19 個饋喇叭，涵蓋 1.05–1.45 GHz、雙線偏振，低雜訊放大器低溫冷卻，中心波束在 ζ \u003c 26.4° 時 T_sys \u003c 24 K；外圈波束偏離光軸，增益略低並帶彗形。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"Nineteen feed horns in a hexagonal layout sit at the focal plane covering 1.05–1.45 GHz in dual linear polarisation with cryogenically cooled low-noise amplifiers, and the central beam reaches T_sys \u003c 24 K for ζ \u003c 26.4°; outer beams sit off axis with slightly lower gain and some coma. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":1,"sequence":25},{"id":"a500-v12-26","title":"19 波束接收、雜訊注入與駐波基線：定量估算","titleEn":"19-beam reception, noise injection and standing-wave baselines: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-25"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「19 波束 L 波段接收機」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “19-beam L-band receiver” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：駐波週期 Δν = c/(2h) = 3×10⁸/(2 × 140) ≈ 1.07 MHz；200 km/s 的 HI 線寬在 1420.4 MHz 為 0.95 MHz，兩者同量級。漂移：源穿越 2.9′ = 174″ 的波束需 174/(15 × cos25.65°) ≈ 12.9 s；SEFD 1.49 Jy、通道寬 500 MHz/65 536 = 7.63 kHz、雙偏振時 σ = 1.49/√(2 × 7630 × 12.9) ≈ 3.4 mJy。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Standing-wave period Δν = c/(2h) = 3×10⁸/(2 × 140) ≈ 1.07 MHz, while a 200 km/s HI line at 1420.4 MHz is 0.95 MHz wide, the same scale. Drift: a source crosses the 2.9′ = 174″ beam in 174/(15 × cos25.65°) ≈ 12.9 s; with SEFD 1.49 Jy, a 500 MHz/65 536 = 7.63 kHz channel and two polarisations, σ = 1.49/√(2 × 7630 × 12.9) ≈ 3.4 mJy per beam crossing. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以秒級週期開關雜訊二極體，從開關差值追蹤增益穩定度（試運行要求 3.5 小時內優於 1%）；逐波束量 T_sys 對頻率與 ζ 的變化；對空白天區在不同饋源軸向位置觀測，量出漣波週期與相位隨距離的變化並與 c/2h 比較；再用校準源映射確認每個波束的位置與增益。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Switch the noise diode on a seconds-scale period and track gain stability from the on-off difference, with commissioning requiring better than 1% over 3.5 hours; measure T_sys versus frequency and ζ for every beam; observe blank sky at several axial feed positions to measure ripple period and phase versus distance and compare with c/2h; then map a calibrator to confirm each beam's position and gain.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-26-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"駐波週期 Δν = c/(2h) = 3×10⁸/(2 × 140) ≈ 1.07 MHz；200 km/s 的 HI 線寬在 1420.4 MHz 為 0.95 MHz，兩者同量級。漂移：源穿越 2.9′ = 174″ 的波束需 174/(15 × cos25.65°) ≈ 12.9 s；SEFD 1.49 Jy、通道寬 500 MHz/65 536 = 7.63 kHz、雙偏振時 σ = 1.49/√(2 × 7630 × 12.9) ≈ 3.4 mJy。","textEn":"Standing-wave period Δν = c/(2h) = 3×10⁸/(2 × 140) ≈ 1.07 MHz, while a 200 km/s HI line at 1420.4 MHz is 0.95 MHz wide, the same scale. Drift: a source crosses the 2.9′ = 174″ beam in 174/(15 × cos25.65°) ≈ 12.9 s; with SEFD 1.49 Jy, a 500 MHz/65 536 = 7.63 kHz channel and two polarisations, σ = 1.49/√(2 × 7630 × 12.9) ≈ 3.4 mJy per beam crossing.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-26-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「19 波束接收、雜訊注入與駐波基線」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"19-beam reception, noise injection and standing-wave baselines\", which statement holds?","options":["FAST 反射面固定不動，所以增益與天頂角無關。","只要控制六根鋼索長度，饋源艙就能直接達到毫米級定位。","駐波週期 Δν = c/(2h) = 3×10⁸/(2 × 140) ≈ 1.07 MHz。"],"optionsEn":["Because FAST's dish never moves, its gain does not depend on zenith angle.","Controlling the six cable lengths alone puts the feed cabin to millimetre accuracy.","Standing-wave period Δν = c/(2h) = 3×10⁸/(2 × 140) ≈ 1.07 MHz, while a 200 km/s HI line at 1420.4 MHz is 0.95 MHz wide, the same scale."],"answer":2,"explanation":"駐波週期 Δν = c/(2h) = 3×10⁸/(2 × 140) ≈ 1.07 MHz；200 km/s 的 HI 線寬在 1420.4 MHz 為 0.95 MHz，兩者同量級。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Standing-wave period Δν = c/(2h) = 3×10⁸/(2 × 140) ≈ 1.07 MHz, while a 200 km/s HI line at 1420.4 MHz is 0.95 MHz wide, the same scale. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"model","order":2,"sequence":26},{"id":"a500-v12-27","title":"19 波束接收、雜訊注入與駐波基線：量測與驗證","titleEn":"19-beam reception, noise injection and standing-wave baselines: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-26"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「19 波束 L 波段接收機」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “19-beam L-band receiver” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以秒級週期開關雜訊二極體，從開關差值追蹤增益穩定度（試運行要求 3.5 小時內優於 1%）；逐波束量 T_sys 對頻率與 ζ 的變化；對空白天區在不同饋源軸向位置觀測，量出漣波週期與相位隨距離的變化並與 c/2h 比較；再用校準源映射確認每個波束的位置與增益。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Switch the noise diode on a seconds-scale period and track gain stability from the on-off difference, with commissioning requiring better than 1% over 3.5 hours; measure T_sys versus frequency and ζ for every beam; observe blank sky at several axial feed positions to measure ripple period and phase versus distance and compare with c/2h; then map a calibrator to confirm each beam's position and gain. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：未扣除的駐波漣波在頻譜上出現約 1 MHz 寬的起伏，被誤認為 HI 偵測；雜訊二極體輸出隨溫度漂移時，所有流量校正帶數個百分比的系統誤差；強干擾使 ADC 飽和，整個頻帶的資料都受污染而必須剔除。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Unremoved standing-wave ripple produces 1 MHz-wide bumps in spectra that are mistaken for HI detections; a noise diode whose output drifts with temperature puts a systematic error of several percent into every flux calibration; strong interference saturates the ADC and contaminates the whole band, forcing the data to be flagged.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-27-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以秒級週期開關雜訊二極體，從開關差值追蹤增益穩定度（試運行要求 3.5 小時內優於 1%）；逐波束量 T_sys 對頻率與 ζ 的變化；對空白天區在不同饋源軸向位置觀測，量出漣波週期與相位隨距離的變化並與 c/2h 比較；再用校準源映射確認每個波束的位置與增益。","textEn":"Switch the noise diode on a seconds-scale period and track gain stability from the on-off difference, with commissioning requiring better than 1% over 3.5 hours; measure T_sys versus frequency and ζ for every beam; observe blank sky at several axial feed positions to measure ripple period and phase versus distance and compare with c/2h; then map a calibrator to confirm each beam's position and gain.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-27-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「19 波束接收、雜訊注入與駐波基線」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"19-beam reception, noise injection and standing-wave baselines\"?","options":["以秒級週期開關雜訊二極體，從開關差值追蹤增益穩定度（試運行要求 3.5 小時內優於 1%）。","量測時不必記錄溫度、振動與時間等條件，因為它們不會影響結果。","5 mm 的面形精度在 500 MHz 與 3 GHz 一樣好。"],"optionsEn":["Switch the noise diode on a seconds-scale period and track gain stability from the on-off difference, with commissioning requiring better than 1% over 3.5 hours.","Temperature, vibration and timing need not be recorded because they cannot affect the result.","A 5 mm surface performs equally well at 500 MHz and 3 GHz."],"answer":0,"explanation":"以秒級週期開關雜訊二極體，從開關差值追蹤增益穩定度（試運行要求 3.5 小時內優於 1%）；逐波束量 T_sys 對頻率與 ζ 的變化；對空白天區在不同饋源軸向位置觀測，量出漣波週期與相位隨距離的變化並與 c/2h 比較；再用校準源映射確認每個波束的位置與增益。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Switch the noise diode on a seconds-scale period and track gain stability from the on-off difference, with commissioning requiring better than 1% over 3.5 hours; measure T_sys versus frequency and ζ for every beam; observe blank sky at several axial feed positions to measure ripple period and phase versus distance and compare with c/2h; then map a calibrator to confirm each beam's position and gain. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"verification","order":3,"sequence":27},{"id":"a500-v12-28","title":"19 波束接收、雜訊注入與駐波基線：失效診斷","titleEn":"19-beam reception, noise injection and standing-wave baselines: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-27"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「19 波束 L 波段接收機」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “19-beam L-band receiver” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"未扣除的駐波漣波在頻譜上出現約 1 MHz 寬的起伏，被誤認為 HI 偵測；雜訊二極體輸出隨溫度漂移時，所有流量校正帶數個百分比的系統誤差；強干擾使 ADC 飽和，整個頻帶的資料都受污染而必須剔除。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Unremoved standing-wave ripple produces 1 MHz-wide bumps in spectra that are mistaken for HI detections; a noise diode whose output drifts with temperature puts a systematic error of several percent into every flux calibration; strong interference saturates the ADC and contaminates the whole band, forcing the data to be flagged. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：漂移掃描利用地球自轉，多波束讓巡天速度提高約 19 倍。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: Drift scans use Earth rotation, and the multibeam raises survey speed about nineteenfold.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「頻譜基線漣波只來自接收機電子，與望遠鏡幾何無關。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"Spectral baseline ripple comes only from receiver electronics, not telescope geometry.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-28-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"未扣除的駐波漣波在頻譜上出現約 1 MHz 寬的起伏，被誤認為 HI 偵測；雜訊二極體輸出隨溫度漂移時，所有流量校正帶數個百分比的系統誤差；強干擾使 ADC 飽和，整個頻帶的資料都受污染而必須剔除。","textEn":"Unremoved standing-wave ripple produces 1 MHz-wide bumps in spectra that are mistaken for HI detections; a noise diode whose output drifts with temperature puts a systematic error of several percent into every flux calibration; strong interference saturates the ADC and contaminates the whole band, forcing the data to be flagged.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-28-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「19 波束接收、雜訊注入與駐波基線」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"19-beam reception, noise injection and standing-wave baselines\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["所有異常都來自操作人員失誤，系統設計不需要檢討。","未扣除的駐波漣波在頻譜上出現約 1 MHz 寬的起伏，被誤認為 HI 偵測。","電波寧靜區可以擋掉所有干擾，包括衛星訊號。"],"optionsEn":["Every anomaly is operator error, so the system design never needs review.","Unremoved standing-wave ripple produces 1 MHz-wide bumps in spectra that are mistaken for HI detections.","A radio quiet zone blocks all interference, satellite signals included."],"answer":1,"explanation":"未扣除的駐波漣波在頻譜上出現約 1 MHz 寬的起伏，被誤認為 HI 偵測；雜訊二極體輸出隨溫度漂移時，所有流量校正帶數個百分比的系統誤差；強干擾使 ADC 飽和，整個頻帶的資料都受污染而必須剔除。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Unremoved standing-wave ripple produces 1 MHz-wide bumps in spectra that are mistaken for HI detections; a noise diode whose output drifts with temperature puts a systematic error of several percent into every flux calibration; strong interference saturates the ADC and contaminates the whole band, forcing the data to be flagged. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":7,"unitFacet":"failure","order":4,"sequence":28},{"id":"a500-v12-29","title":"電波寧靜區、試運行驗收與交接：原理與系統邊界","titleEn":"Radio quiet zone, commissioning acceptance and handoff: mechanism and system boundary","estimatedMinutes":20,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-28"],"objective":"說明「電波寧靜區與驗收紀錄」如何決定FAST 五百公尺口徑球面電波望遠鏡的關鍵性能，並畫出其輸入、輸出與邊界。","objectiveEn":"Explain how “Radio quiet zone and acceptance record” determines the key performance of “FAST Five-hundred-meter Aperture Spherical Telescope”, and map its inputs, outputs and boundaries.","instruction":"喀斯特窪地與四周山體遮擋地面干擾，貴州並劃設電波寧靜區，核心區約 5 km 內居民遷出並限制電子設備；站內電子設備放在屏蔽室，訊號以光纖傳輸，並有常駐的干擾監測站。試運行驗收把量到的性能與設計並列：口徑效率約 0.63、T_sys \u003c 24 K（ζ \u003c 26.4°）、指向 7.9″ rms、增益穩定度 3.5 小時內優於 1%；FAST 於 2020 年 1 月通過國家驗收。交接紀錄要包含各波束與天頂角的增益曲線、雜訊二極體校正表、指向模型版本、面形控制狀態與干擾目錄。 師傅任務：以方塊圖畫出能量或訊號通過「電波寧靜區與驗收紀錄」的路徑，標出哪些量由設計決定、哪些由環境或製造決定，再用三句話寫出機制摘要。","instructionEn":"The karst depression and surrounding hills shield ground-based interference, and Guizhou designated a radio quiet zone whose core of about 5 km was cleared of residents with electronic devices restricted; on-site electronics sit in shielded rooms, signals travel over fibre, and a permanent station monitors interference. Commissioning acceptance sets measured performance beside design: aperture efficiency about 0.63, T_sys \u003c 24 K for ζ \u003c 26.4°, pointing 7.9″ rms and gain stability better than 1% over 3.5 hours; FAST passed national acceptance in January 2020. The handoff record must hold gain curves per beam and zenith angle, noise-diode calibration tables, the pointing-model version, surface-control status and the interference catalogue. Mentor task: draw a block diagram of the energy or signal path through “Radio quiet zone and acceptance record”, mark which quantities are fixed by design and which by environment or fabrication, then summarise the mechanism in three sentences.","observation":"量級提示：自由空間損耗 FSPL = 20log(5000) + 20log(1.4×10⁹) − 147.55 ≈ 109.4 dB。","observationEn":"Order-of-magnitude cue: Free-space loss FSPL = 20log(5000) + 20log(1.4×10⁹) − 147.55 ≈ 109.4 dB.","failure":"常見誤解：「電波寧靜區可以擋掉所有干擾，包括衛星訊號。」這個說法忽略了上述機制；請在方塊圖上指出它錯在哪一個環節。","failureEn":"Common misconception: \"A radio quiet zone blocks all interference, satellite signals included.\" It ignores the mechanism above; mark on your block diagram where it breaks down.","check":"方塊圖標明「電波寧靜區與驗收紀錄」的輸入、輸出與邊界；三句摘要能解釋本步列出的誤解為何不成立。","checkEn":"The block diagram shows inputs, outputs and boundaries of “Radio quiet zone and acceptance record”; the three-sentence summary explains why the listed misconception fails.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-29-k1","title":"電波寧靜區、試運行驗收與交接","titleEn":"Radio quiet zone, commissioning acceptance and handoff","text":"喀斯特窪地與四周山體遮擋地面干擾，貴州並劃設電波寧靜區，核心區約 5 km 內居民遷出並限制電子設備；站內電子設備放在屏蔽室，訊號以光纖傳輸，並有常駐的干擾監測站。試運行驗收把量到的性能與設計並列：口徑效率約 0.63、T_sys \u003c 24 K（ζ \u003c 26.4°）、指向 7.9″ rms、增益穩定度 3.5 小時內優於 1%；FAST 於 2020 年 1 月通過國家驗收。","textEn":"The karst depression and surrounding hills shield ground-based interference, and Guizhou designated a radio quiet zone whose core of about 5 km was cleared of residents with electronic devices restricted; on-site electronics sit in shielded rooms, signals travel over fibre, and a permanent station monitors interference. Commissioning acceptance sets measured performance beside design: aperture efficiency about 0.63, T_sys \u003c 24 K for ζ \u003c 26.4°, pointing 7.9″ rms and gain stability better than 1% over 3.5 hours; FAST passed national acceptance in January 2020.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-29-k2","title":"誤解辨析","titleEn":"Misconception check","text":"誤解：電波寧靜區可以擋掉所有干擾，包括衛星訊號。 正確的工程判斷必須回到機制與量級。","textEn":"Misconception: A radio quiet zone blocks all interference, satellite signals included. Sound engineering judgement goes back to mechanism and magnitude.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"關於「電波寧靜區、試運行驗收與交接」，下列哪一項敘述正確？","questionEn":"Which statement about \"Radio quiet zone, commissioning acceptance and handoff\" is correct?","options":["電波寧靜區可以擋掉所有干擾，包括衛星訊號。","FAST 觀測時會把整個 500 m 反射面變成一個拋物面。","喀斯特窪地與四周山體遮擋地面干擾，貴州並劃設電波寧靜區，核心區約 5 km 內居民遷出並限制電子設備。"],"optionsEn":["A radio quiet zone blocks all interference, satellite signals included.","FAST deforms its whole 500 m dish into a single paraboloid when observing.","The karst depression and surrounding hills shield ground-based interference, and Guizhou designated a radio quiet zone whose core of about 5 km was cleared of residents with electronic devices restricted."],"answer":2,"explanation":"喀斯特窪地與四周山體遮擋地面干擾，貴州並劃設電波寧靜區，核心區約 5 km 內居民遷出並限制電子設備；站內電子設備放在屏蔽室，訊號以光纖傳輸，並有常駐的干擾監測站。 其餘選項是常見誤解。","explanationEn":"The karst depression and surrounding hills shield ground-based interference, and Guizhou designated a radio quiet zone whose core of about 5 km was cleared of residents with electronic devices restricted; on-site electronics sit in shielded rooms, signals travel over fibre, and a permanent station monitors interference. The other options are common misconceptions."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"mechanism","order":5,"sequence":29},{"id":"a500-v12-30","title":"電波寧靜區、試運行驗收與交接：定量估算","titleEn":"Radio quiet zone, commissioning acceptance and handoff: quantitative estimate","estimatedMinutes":30,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-29"],"objective":"以數值模型估算「電波寧靜區與驗收紀錄」的關鍵量，並判斷參數改變時結果的方向與幅度。","objectiveEn":"Estimate the key quantities of “Radio quiet zone and acceptance record” with a numerical model and judge the direction and size of changes when a parameter moves.","instruction":"依下列模型逐步重算：自由空間損耗 FSPL = 20log(5000) + 20log(1.4×10⁹) − 147.55 ≈ 109.4 dB。若某設備在單一 7.63 kHz 通道內洩漏 −60 dBm，經 0 dBi 旁瓣收到 −169.4 dBm；輻射計雜訊 k·T_sys·√(Δν/t) 在 1 s 為 −165.4 dBm、積分 1 小時為 −183.2 dBm，干擾高出 14 dB，足以污染長積分的譜線觀測。 師傅任務：保留單位重算一次，再只改變一個輸入（例如增加 10%），預測並計算輸出的變化，說明它是線性、平方或更高次方的關係。","instructionEn":"Recalculate step by step: Free-space loss FSPL = 20log(5000) + 20log(1.4×10⁹) − 147.55 ≈ 109.4 dB. A device leaking −60 dBm into one 7.63 kHz channel arrives at −169.4 dBm through a 0 dBi sidelobe; radiometer noise k·T_sys·√(Δν/t) is −165.4 dBm in 1 s and −183.2 dBm after 1 hour, so the interference sits 14 dB above it and spoils long spectral-line integrations. Mentor task: redo the calculation keeping units, then change one input (for example by +10%), predict and compute the output change, and state whether the dependence is linear, quadratic or steeper.","observation":"如何核對：以全向與指向天線的監測站持續掃描頻帶，統計干擾佔用率並與歷史比較；逐一開關站內子系統（促動器驅動器、艙內電子、冷頭壓縮機）找出自生干擾；最後依固定順序填寫驗收表：效率、T_sys、指向、增益穩定度與干擾統計，每項附上量測日期、ζ 範圍與允收值。","observationEn":"How to cross-check: Run the monitoring station with omnidirectional and directional antennas to scan the band continuously and compare occupancy statistics with history; switch on-site subsystems on and off one at a time, including actuator drivers, cabin electronics and cryocooler compressors, to find self-generated interference; finally fill the acceptance table in fixed order with efficiency, T_sys, pointing, gain stability and interference statistics, each with measurement date, ζ range and allowance.","failure":"計算陷阱：單位換算錯誤、把教學假設當成設備規格，或只看結果不檢查數量級，都會讓後續設計判斷失準。","failureEn":"Calculation traps: unit conversion slips, treating teaching assumptions as equipment specifications, or accepting a result without checking its magnitude will mislead later design decisions.","check":"重現模型中的數值（取整誤差在 ±5% 內），並提交一個參數改變後的敏感度計算與物理解釋。","checkEn":"Reproduce the model values (within ±5% rounding) and submit a sensitivity calculation for one changed parameter with a physical explanation.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-30-k1","title":"定量模型","titleEn":"Quantitative model","text":"自由空間損耗 FSPL = 20log(5000) + 20log(1.4×10⁹) − 147.55 ≈ 109.4 dB。若某設備在單一 7.63 kHz 通道內洩漏 −60 dBm，經 0 dBi 旁瓣收到 −169.4 dBm；輻射計雜訊 k·T_sys·√(Δν/t) 在 1 s 為 −165.4 dBm、積分 1 小時為 −183.2 dBm，干擾高出 14 dB，足以污染長積分的譜線觀測。","textEn":"Free-space loss FSPL = 20log(5000) + 20log(1.4×10⁹) − 147.55 ≈ 109.4 dB. A device leaking −60 dBm into one 7.63 kHz channel arrives at −169.4 dBm through a 0 dBi sidelobe; radiometer noise k·T_sys·√(Δν/t) is −165.4 dBm in 1 s and −183.2 dBm after 1 hour, so the interference sits 14 dB above it and spoils long spectral-line integrations.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-30-k2","title":"模型邊界","titleEn":"Model boundary","text":"本步數值為教學假設；套用到實際設備前，必須重新取得規格、操作條件與不確定度。","textEn":"These numbers are teaching assumptions; before applying them to real equipment, obtain the actual specifications, operating conditions and uncertainties.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"依「電波寧靜區、試運行驗收與交接」的定量模型，下列哪一項敘述成立？","questionEn":"According to the quantitative model for \"Radio quiet zone, commissioning acceptance and handoff\", which statement holds?","options":["自由空間損耗 FSPL = 20log(5000) + 20log(1.4×10⁹) − 147.55 ≈ 109.4 dB。","索網只承受靜態重量，不必考慮疲勞壽命。","5 mm 的面形精度在 500 MHz 與 3 GHz 一樣好。"],"optionsEn":["Free-space loss FSPL = 20log(5000) + 20log(1.4×10⁹) − 147.55 ≈ 109.4 dB.","The cable net carries only static weight, so fatigue life can be ignored.","A 5 mm surface performs equally well at 500 MHz and 3 GHz."],"answer":0,"explanation":"自由空間損耗 FSPL = 20log(5000) + 20log(1.4×10⁹) − 147.55 ≈ 109.4 dB。 重算時請保留單位。","explanationEn":"Free-space loss FSPL = 20log(5000) + 20log(1.4×10⁹) − 147.55 ≈ 109.4 dB. Keep units when recalculating."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"model","order":6,"sequence":30},{"id":"a500-v12-31","title":"電波寧靜區、試運行驗收與交接：量測與驗證","titleEn":"Radio quiet zone, commissioning acceptance and handoff: measurement and verification","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-30"],"objective":"設計一項可重複的量測，驗證「電波寧靜區與驗收紀錄」是否符合模型預期，並訂出允收準則。","objectiveEn":"Design a repeatable measurement that verifies whether “Radio quiet zone and acceptance record” meets the model expectation, and set acceptance criteria.","instruction":"以全向與指向天線的監測站持續掃描頻帶，統計干擾佔用率並與歷史比較；逐一開關站內子系統（促動器驅動器、艙內電子、冷頭壓縮機）找出自生干擾；最後依固定順序填寫驗收表：效率、T_sys、指向、增益穩定度與干擾統計，每項附上量測日期、ζ 範圍與允收值。 師傅任務：把上述方法寫成量測計畫，列出儀器、基準件或參考樣品、步驟、比較對象與允收準則，並估計三項主要不確定度來源。","instructionEn":"Run the monitoring station with omnidirectional and directional antennas to scan the band continuously and compare occupancy statistics with history; switch on-site subsystems on and off one at a time, including actuator drivers, cabin electronics and cryocooler compressors, to find self-generated interference; finally fill the acceptance table in fixed order with efficiency, T_sys, pointing, gain stability and interference statistics, each with measurement date, ζ range and allowance. Mentor task: turn this into a measurement plan listing instruments, reference artefacts or samples, procedure, comparison baseline and acceptance criteria, and estimate the three largest uncertainty contributions.","observation":"注意干擾：兩千多台促動器驅動器或艙內電子的寬頻雜訊若未屏蔽，望遠鏡自己污染自己；L 波段的導航衛星無法被地形與寧靜區擋住，強訊號使 ADC 飽和，該時段整個頻帶都必須剔除。","observationEn":"Watch for interference: Unshielded broadband noise from the two thousand actuator drivers or cabin electronics lets the telescope pollute itself; L-band navigation satellites cannot be blocked by terrain or a quiet zone, and their strong signals saturate the ADC so the whole band must be flagged for that interval.","failure":"驗證陷阱：只量一次、沒有可追溯的基準，或不記錄環境條件，就無法分辨真正的偏差與量測誤差。","failureEn":"Verification traps: a single measurement, no traceable reference, or unrecorded environmental conditions make real deviations indistinguishable from measurement error.","check":"提交量測計畫：儀器、基準、步驟、允收準則與不確定度預算，並說明如何判定合格或不合格。","checkEn":"Submit the measurement plan: instruments, reference, procedure, acceptance criteria and uncertainty budget, with the pass/fail decision rule.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-31-k1","title":"驗證方法","titleEn":"Verification method","text":"以全向與指向天線的監測站持續掃描頻帶，統計干擾佔用率並與歷史比較；逐一開關站內子系統（促動器驅動器、艙內電子、冷頭壓縮機）找出自生干擾；最後依固定順序填寫驗收表：效率、T_sys、指向、增益穩定度與干擾統計，每項附上量測日期、ζ 範圍與允收值。","textEn":"Run the monitoring station with omnidirectional and directional antennas to scan the band continuously and compare occupancy statistics with history; switch on-site subsystems on and off one at a time, including actuator drivers, cabin electronics and cryocooler compressors, to find self-generated interference; finally fill the acceptance table in fixed order with efficiency, T_sys, pointing, gain stability and interference statistics, each with measurement date, ζ range and allowance.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-31-k2","title":"允收與不確定度","titleEn":"Acceptance and uncertainty","text":"允收準則必須在量測前訂定，並與擴充不確定度一起陳述；比較基準需可追溯。","textEn":"Acceptance criteria are fixed before measuring and stated together with expanded uncertainty; the comparison reference must be traceable.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"要驗證「電波寧靜區、試運行驗收與交接」，下列哪一個做法最恰當？","questionEn":"Which approach best verifies \"Radio quiet zone, commissioning acceptance and handoff\"?","options":["沿用另一台設備或另一個案例的量測結果，就可視為本系統已完成驗證。","以全向與指向天線的監測站持續掃描頻帶，統計干擾佔用率並與歷史比較。","相對 140 m 焦距，10 mm 的饋源誤差可以忽略。"],"optionsEn":["Reusing results from another instrument or another case counts as verifying this system.","Run the monitoring station with omnidirectional and directional antennas to scan the band continuously and compare occupancy statistics with history.","A 10 mm feed error is negligible against a 140 m focal length."],"answer":1,"explanation":"以全向與指向天線的監測站持續掃描頻帶，統計干擾佔用率並與歷史比較；逐一開關站內子系統（促動器驅動器、艙內電子、冷頭壓縮機）找出自生干擾；最後依固定順序填寫驗收表：效率、T_sys、指向、增益穩定度與干擾統計，每項附上量測日期、ζ 範圍與允收值。 驗證需要基準、重複性與允收準則。","explanationEn":"Run the monitoring station with omnidirectional and directional antennas to scan the band continuously and compare occupancy statistics with history; switch on-site subsystems on and off one at a time, including actuator drivers, cabin electronics and cryocooler compressors, to find self-generated interference; finally fill the acceptance table in fixed order with efficiency, T_sys, pointing, gain stability and interference statistics, each with measurement date, ζ range and allowance. Verification needs a reference, repeatability and acceptance criteria."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"verification","order":7,"sequence":31},{"id":"a500-v12-32","title":"電波寧靜區、試運行驗收與交接：失效診斷","titleEn":"Radio quiet zone, commissioning acceptance and handoff: failure diagnosis","estimatedMinutes":25,"simulationOnly":true,"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"prerequisiteIds":["a500-v12-31"],"objective":"從症狀倒推「電波寧靜區與驗收紀錄」的失效原因，提出能區分原因的檢查與矯正措施。","objectiveEn":"Work back from symptoms to the failure causes of “Radio quiet zone and acceptance record” and propose discriminating checks and corrective actions.","instruction":"兩千多台促動器驅動器或艙內電子的寬頻雜訊若未屏蔽，望遠鏡自己污染自己；L 波段的導航衛星無法被地形與寧靜區擋住，強訊號使 ADC 飽和，該時段整個頻帶都必須剔除。 師傅任務：建立失效樹——症狀、兩個以上可能原因、能區分它們的量測，以及矯正與預防措施；並說明此失效如何影響整個系統的性能、良率或安全。","instructionEn":"Unshielded broadband noise from the two thousand actuator drivers or cabin electronics lets the telescope pollute itself; L-band navigation satellites cannot be blocked by terrain or a quiet zone, and their strong signals saturate the ADC so the whole band must be flagged for that interval. Mentor task: build a fault tree with the symptom, at least two candidate causes, a measurement that tells them apart, and corrective and preventive actions; explain how the failure affects whole-system performance, yield or safety.","observation":"連結機制：交接紀錄要包含各波束與天頂角的增益曲線、雜訊二極體校正表、指向模型版本、面形控制狀態與干擾目錄。","observationEn":"Link to the mechanism: The handoff record must hold gain curves per beam and zenith angle, noise-diode calibration tables, the pointing-model version, surface-control status and the interference catalogue.","failure":"誤判風險：若相信「電波寧靜區可以擋掉所有干擾，包括衛星訊號。」，上述症狀可能被錯誤處理而反覆出現。","failureEn":"Misdiagnosis risk: believing \"A radio quiet zone blocks all interference, satellite signals included.\" leads to mishandling the symptom so it keeps returning.","check":"完成失效樹與矯正措施，並指出哪一項量測能最快確認根因、如何防止再發。","checkEn":"Complete the fault tree and corrective actions, name the measurement that confirms the root cause fastest, and state how recurrence is prevented.","knowledge":[{"id":"a500-v12-32-k1","title":"失效模式","titleEn":"Failure mode","text":"兩千多台促動器驅動器或艙內電子的寬頻雜訊若未屏蔽，望遠鏡自己污染自己；L 波段的導航衛星無法被地形與寧靜區擋住，強訊號使 ADC 飽和，該時段整個頻帶都必須剔除。","textEn":"Unshielded broadband noise from the two thousand actuator drivers or cabin electronics lets the telescope pollute itself; L-band navigation satellites cannot be blocked by terrain or a quiet zone, and their strong signals saturate the ADC so the whole band must be flagged for that interval.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]},{"id":"a500-v12-32-k2","title":"根因確認","titleEn":"Root-cause confirmation","text":"根因必須以可區分的量測確認；只更換零件或放寬參數可能掩蓋問題。","textEn":"Confirm the root cause with a discriminating measurement; merely swapping parts or relaxing limits can mask the problem.","sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"]}],"quiz":{"question":"在「電波寧靜區、試運行驗收與交接」出現異常時，下列哪一項判斷最合理？","questionEn":"When \"Radio quiet zone, commissioning acceptance and handoff\" misbehaves, which diagnosis is most reasonable?","options":["調高增益或放寬允收值，就能解決大多數異常。","FAST 觀測時會把整個 500 m 反射面變成一個拋物面。","兩千多台促動器驅動器或艙內電子的寬頻雜訊若未屏蔽，望遠鏡自己污染自己。"],"optionsEn":["Raising the gain or widening the acceptance limits solves most anomalies.","FAST deforms its whole 500 m dish into a single paraboloid when observing.","Unshielded broadband noise from the two thousand actuator drivers or cabin electronics lets the telescope pollute itself."],"answer":2,"explanation":"兩千多台促動器驅動器或艙內電子的寬頻雜訊若未屏蔽，望遠鏡自己污染自己；L 波段的導航衛星無法被地形與寧靜區擋住，強訊號使 ADC 飽和，該時段整個頻帶都必須剔除。 需以量測區分可能原因。","explanationEn":"Unshielded broadband noise from the two thousand actuator drivers or cabin electronics lets the telescope pollute itself; L-band navigation satellites cannot be blocked by terrain or a quiet zone, and their strong signals saturate the ADC so the whole band must be flagged for that interval. Discriminate candidate causes by measurement."},"unit":8,"unitFacet":"failure","order":8,"sequence":32}],"order":4}],"sourceIds":["v12o-naoc-fast-overview","v12o-nan-2011-fast-project","v12o-jiang-2020-fast-19beam","v12o-cas-fast-1000-pulsars"],"curriculumVersion":12,"stepCount":32,"estimatedMinutes":800}};
